1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:01:59,480
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

2
00:02:04,270 --> 00:02:08,050
No living being was harmed during the
filming of this series.

3
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:13,430
Episode 111

4
00:02:27,020 --> 00:02:28,090
Let's go!

5
00:03:20,470 --> 00:03:21,720
I had to go too.

6
00:03:22,150 --> 00:03:23,710
What if something happened
to my father?

7
00:03:23,710 --> 00:03:25,290
I can't wait like this.

8
00:03:25,490 --> 00:03:26,400
I will go.

9
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:28,150
Calm down, Bala.

10
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:31,450
Inshallah, nothing will
happen to our Sheikh.

11
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:43,460
Alps and the Sisters are in Yenişehir.

12
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:47,670
Do not worry.

13
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:50,960
No bird will fly without our knowledge.

14
00:03:52,570 --> 00:03:54,630
Keep your eyes open, Ayşe.

15
00:04:00,630 --> 00:04:02,240
Ülgen Hatun sent me.

16
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:06,570
She sent me saying you didn't
eat anything, so at least drink this.

17
00:04:06,950 --> 00:04:07,970
Thank you.

18
00:04:15,660 --> 00:04:17,040
It is important.

19
00:04:22,910 --> 00:04:24,360
I'll see Halime.

20
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,260
Bala.

21
00:04:25,810 --> 00:04:27,170
Do not worry.

22
00:04:59,580 --> 00:05:02,740
Brothers! Come on!

23
00:05:03,470 --> 00:05:05,130
Come on!

24
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:39,250
Boran, shields won't hold.

25
00:05:39,250 --> 00:05:40,050
It's a trap.

26
00:05:40,050 --> 00:05:41,630
It's a trap, brothers, move!

27
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:43,700
We'll take shelter in shields.
Come on!

28
00:05:43,700 --> 00:05:44,810
Let's go!

29
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:46,590
Come on!

30
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,160
Open.

31
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,240
Take cover!

32
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:09,860
Open.

33
00:06:12,230 --> 00:06:13,070
Take cover!

34
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,000
Open.

35
00:06:21,510 --> 00:06:22,540
Take cover!

36
00:06:26,170 --> 00:06:28,730
My Bey will enter the Khanqah, brothers.

37
00:06:28,730 --> 00:06:30,230
We will enter the Khan.

38
00:06:30,230 --> 00:06:31,490
Let's go!

39
00:08:08,490 --> 00:08:10,590
It's a trap, take cover.

40
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:42,010
My Bey, what are we going to do?

41
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:45,490
Wait, Alps!

42
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:46,950
Wait.

43
00:08:59,670 --> 00:09:00,890
Now!

44
00:09:04,110 --> 00:09:05,080
Take cover!

45
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:09,080
Open.

46
00:09:12,350 --> 00:09:13,790
Take cover.

47
00:09:26,270 --> 00:09:26,990
Open.

48
00:09:43,950 --> 00:09:45,220
Alps!

49
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:49,040
Be careful.

50
00:09:50,100 --> 00:09:51,340
There is no sound.

51
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:53,630
Let's go slowly.

52
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:54,860
Let's go.

53
00:10:24,460 --> 00:10:26,680
What's going on, Esma? Why did you
summon me?

54
00:10:31,510 --> 00:10:33,410
They asked me to give you this.

55
00:10:34,250 --> 00:10:36,750
However, they
commanded that only you should see it.

56
00:10:37,930 --> 00:10:39,310
Who gave you this?

57
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:42,010
Someone I do not know.

58
00:10:43,300 --> 00:10:45,620
However, Mother Sultan has sent it...

59
00:10:46,150 --> 00:10:47,680
...just for you.

60
00:10:49,230 --> 00:10:51,550
Sheikh Edebali is at Marmaracık Castle.

61
00:10:51,550 --> 00:10:54,150
You'll be there alone by noon.

62
00:10:54,510 --> 00:10:56,320
If you try to deceive me in any way...

63
00:10:56,350 --> 00:10:59,040
Or if you don't come, your
father will die, Bala Hatun.

64
00:10:59,110 --> 00:11:00,640
You or your father.

65
00:11:01,810 --> 00:11:03,020
İsmihan.

66
00:11:11,730 --> 00:11:12,810
Who is it, Esma?

67
00:11:12,830 --> 00:11:14,750
I ask you who is she? I don't know.

68
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:16,340
I swear, I don't know!

69
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:18,290
I don't know!

70
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:20,930
Esma, it's up to my father!

71
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:22,560
If you are lying...

72
00:11:22,590 --> 00:11:23,710
I will not forgive you.

73
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,480
A man came...

74
00:11:26,750 --> 00:11:28,550
and put a paper in my hand.

75
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:30,650
He said it is from
Mother Sultan.

76
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:33,460
He told me to give it to Bala Hatun only.

77
00:11:35,270 --> 00:11:37,260
I don't know anything else.

78
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:48,250
My Sheikh, my Sheikh!

79
00:11:51,060 --> 00:11:52,330
My Sheikh.

80
00:11:54,310 --> 00:11:55,350
My Sheikh.

81
00:11:56,430 --> 00:11:58,120
Who did this to my Sheikh?

82
00:11:58,140 --> 00:12:01,330
I will drown him in his blood.

83
00:12:40,030 --> 00:12:41,380
Tell Sultan quickly.

84
00:12:50,700 --> 00:12:51,880
Sultan Mesut.

85
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:53,850
Osman Bey.

86
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:55,250
Where is the Sheikh?

87
00:12:57,410 --> 00:12:58,920
They're going inside now.

88
00:12:59,140 --> 00:13:01,210
Hurry up, come
on, Mesut, come on!

89
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:02,300
Let's go!

90
00:13:04,630 --> 00:13:06,380
Nobody knows this secret place.

91
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:08,230
Come on, inside, come on.

92
00:13:08,830 --> 00:13:10,720
I will not leave you, Sheikh
Edebali.

93
00:13:10,810 --> 00:13:13,240
No, never mind, Mesut.

94
00:13:13,330 --> 00:13:14,760
They don't know you exist.

95
00:13:14,910 --> 00:13:16,810
They are coming to get me.

96
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:23,890
Hide now to spoil their
games when the time is right, come on.

97
00:13:24,150 --> 00:13:24,990
Come on.

98
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:28,970
Come on, take it
and it'll stay with you.

99
00:13:30,340 --> 00:13:31,810
Faster.

100
00:13:32,090 --> 00:13:33,090
Let's go.

101
00:14:04,860 --> 00:14:06,370
Arrested the Sheikh.

102
00:14:08,330 --> 00:14:09,630
Yazid.

103
00:14:26,940 --> 00:14:27,900
Yazid.

104
00:14:28,050 --> 00:14:29,160
Yazid!

105
00:14:43,710 --> 00:14:46,470
İsmihan raided the Khanqah and took him.

106
00:14:46,880 --> 00:14:49,490
Sheikh Edebali
sacrificed himself for me.

107
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,270
What?

108
00:14:56,850 --> 00:15:00,500
I will shed the blood of those
who did this to my Sheikh.

109
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:02,170
No.

110
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:05,070
My Bey!
Greek fire!

111
00:15:07,770 --> 00:15:09,160
My Sultan!

112
00:15:38,940 --> 00:15:40,110
My Sheikh.

113
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,460
Don't you dare!

114
00:15:47,690 --> 00:15:50,090
Don't do anything without knowing.

115
00:16:08,370 --> 00:16:09,240
Malhun.

116
00:16:09,710 --> 00:16:11,400
Where are you late?

117
00:16:12,870 --> 00:16:16,730
She went saying she was going to check
on Halima and she hasn't come back yet.

118
00:16:17,020 --> 00:16:18,450
Shall we go see her?

119
00:16:20,430 --> 00:16:22,210
Or did she go to Söğüt?

120
00:16:30,930 --> 00:16:32,320
Malhun Hatun.

121
00:16:32,950 --> 00:16:34,790
I will tell you something.

122
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:37,400
Esma, where is Bala?

123
00:16:38,250 --> 00:16:39,490
Bala Hatun.

124
00:16:40,740 --> 00:16:42,720
She sent you news.

125
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:47,880
What news?

126
00:16:49,760 --> 00:16:53,570
She told you to
go to Osman Bey as soon as possible.

127
00:16:54,090 --> 00:16:56,170
She said they lured Osman Bey into a trap.

128
00:16:56,650 --> 00:16:58,370
What are you saying, Esma?

129
00:17:07,829 --> 00:17:09,060
Bala Hatun.

130
00:17:10,990 --> 00:17:13,730
She went to surrender to Mother Sultan.

131
00:17:23,790 --> 00:17:25,859
Are you okay, Sultan Mesut?

132
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:27,050
Cerkutay.

133
00:17:27,250 --> 00:17:28,550
- My Bey.
- Cerkutay.

134
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:29,430
Come.

135
00:17:29,540 --> 00:17:31,120
Look at the entrance of the
road.

136
00:17:31,130 --> 00:17:32,820
How is it? Let's go!

137
00:17:33,850 --> 00:17:37,040
Gürbüz, take Sultan there, come on.

138
00:17:37,940 --> 00:17:39,910
They are coming in
great numbers, my Bey.

139
00:17:39,940 --> 00:17:41,440
Take it, take it, take it!

140
00:17:42,460 --> 00:17:44,080
Take it, take it, take it!

141
00:17:52,690 --> 00:17:54,180
Put it.

142
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:04,310
They are waiting for us, it will be
difficult for us to get out of here.

143
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:05,900
So that's what you say.

144
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:08,040
So let them come.

145
00:18:08,590 --> 00:18:10,020
Let them come.

146
00:18:26,020 --> 00:18:27,700
We were looking for Mesut.

147
00:18:28,530 --> 00:18:30,570
Now, you will both die.

148
00:18:30,570 --> 00:18:33,220
We do not have a soul to
give to dogs and foxes!

149
00:18:34,870 --> 00:18:38,960
We'll chop off your heads first, and then
the heads of those above you.

150
00:18:39,190 --> 00:18:40,200
Come.

151
00:18:59,540 --> 00:19:01,230
İsmihan Sultan.

152
00:19:01,350 --> 00:19:03,200
You make people kill each other.

153
00:19:03,460 --> 00:19:05,590
You will pay very badly for this.

154
00:19:11,650 --> 00:19:13,100
Sultan Mesut.

155
00:19:15,230 --> 00:19:16,520
Are you well?

156
00:19:50,520 --> 00:19:52,800
I see you are very surprised.

157
00:19:56,910 --> 00:19:59,810
Or did our arrival disturb you?

158
00:20:04,530 --> 00:20:06,520
I ask forgiveness from
Allah, Mother Sultan.

159
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:11,100
The castle is yours.

160
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:17,070
I am here because I trust you.

161
00:20:19,810 --> 00:20:23,510
We are pleased with your
confidence, Mother Sultan.

162
00:20:26,020 --> 00:20:29,120
But, my Sheikh...

163
00:20:32,540 --> 00:20:33,860
Why is he restricted?

164
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:35,980
What is happening?

165
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:39,170
Sheikh Edebali is under arrest.

166
00:20:43,050 --> 00:20:48,920
From now on, no one will speak to
him without my permission.

167
00:20:55,010 --> 00:20:56,560
Avcı Bey.

168
00:20:59,010 --> 00:21:01,910
Take Sheikh Edebali to
the dungeon.

169
00:21:08,790 --> 00:21:13,440
What is the crime committed by Sheikh
Edebali to throw him in prison?

170
00:21:18,820 --> 00:21:21,970
Also, does Osman Bey
know about this?

171
00:21:37,730 --> 00:21:41,090
Sorry, Mother Sultan.

172
00:21:41,990 --> 00:21:43,340
Forgive her.

173
00:21:44,230 --> 00:21:46,790
Excuse her for what she said
because of her young age.

174
00:21:51,870 --> 00:21:55,810
I'll ignore this for your
sake, Bengi Hatun.

175
00:22:03,890 --> 00:22:04,900
Avcı Bey.

176
00:22:06,140 --> 00:22:07,890
Deploy the soldiers in the castle.

177
00:22:09,540 --> 00:22:12,240
Do not leave any place empty.

178
00:22:13,250 --> 00:22:15,030
And raise our flags!

179
00:22:19,170 --> 00:22:26,460
From now on, no one will leave the
castle without my permission.

180
00:22:30,250 --> 00:22:32,580
Increase your precautions, Öktem Bey.

181
00:22:35,300 --> 00:22:37,170
Osman will do something.

182
00:23:08,060 --> 00:23:10,430
What's the situation, Boran?

183
00:23:10,460 --> 00:23:12,950
İsmihan was not there
when we came, Malhun Hatun.

184
00:23:13,780 --> 00:23:15,660
She left those here.

185
00:23:15,800 --> 00:23:17,220
Where is Osman?

186
00:23:17,260 --> 00:23:18,480
In the Khanqah.

187
00:23:18,670 --> 00:23:19,860
Well, what about Konur?

188
00:23:20,190 --> 00:23:23,320
Baysungur and the Alps
went to the dungeon to see him.

189
00:23:23,420 --> 00:23:24,810
Be careful.

190
00:23:25,060 --> 00:23:27,440
Go to dungeon, Kumral Abdal.

191
00:23:27,450 --> 00:23:28,980
And I'll go to the Khanqah.

192
00:23:29,950 --> 00:23:31,240
Come on, Alps.

193
00:23:37,030 --> 00:23:38,840
Konur, my brother.

194
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:47,850
My Allah.

195
00:23:49,160 --> 00:23:50,240
Konur.

196
00:24:05,310 --> 00:24:09,960
Dear Konur, what have they
done to you, my brave brother?

197
00:24:10,130 --> 00:24:11,650
Everyone, stay away!

198
00:24:12,600 --> 00:24:14,630
Go away, go away!

199
00:24:15,730 --> 00:24:16,910
Baysungur.

200
00:24:17,780 --> 00:24:19,000
Did you touch him?

201
00:24:20,600 --> 00:24:22,340
What do you say, Kumral Abdal?

202
00:24:26,080 --> 00:24:27,480
These wounds...

203
00:24:45,840 --> 00:24:47,100
he is burning.

204
00:24:50,200 --> 00:24:51,740
This is not good at all.

205
00:24:51,920 --> 00:24:52,920
Don't get close to him.

206
00:24:54,890 --> 00:24:55,890
Konur is breathing...

207
00:24:56,560 --> 00:24:58,110
but he is weak.

208
00:24:58,270 --> 00:24:59,890
It may be an infectious disease.

209
00:25:00,090 --> 00:25:02,970
Tell the rest of the doctors
immediately, Şamil.

210
00:25:03,580 --> 00:25:07,160
Come on, let's all get out, come on.

211
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:33,350
My Bey, İsmihan is in Marmaracık.

212
00:25:34,360 --> 00:25:35,930
Our Sheikh is with her, too.

213
00:25:37,670 --> 00:25:38,970
How do you know, Malhun?

214
00:25:40,280 --> 00:25:42,140
İsmihan sent a message to Bala.

215
00:25:42,920 --> 00:25:46,520
She told her that her father is a prisoner of
hers, if she doesn't come, know that he'll be killed.

216
00:25:46,560 --> 00:25:49,430
She told her to come to
Marmaracık without telling anyone.

217
00:25:50,880 --> 00:25:52,290
Don't say that, Malhun.

218
00:25:54,370 --> 00:25:55,370
Malhun.

219
00:25:56,460 --> 00:25:57,730
Don't say that Bala is gone.

220
00:25:57,980 --> 00:25:58,980
Do not say that.

221
00:26:00,130 --> 00:26:01,130
She's gone, my Bey.

222
00:26:01,890 --> 00:26:02,890
Malhun.

223
00:26:04,000 --> 00:26:06,610
We found out later, so
I couldn't stop her.

224
00:26:23,290 --> 00:26:26,580
You've gone too far, İsmihan.

225
00:26:27,190 --> 00:26:28,190
İsmihan.

226
00:26:28,880 --> 00:26:30,920
Both my Sheikh and Bala.

227
00:26:31,410 --> 00:26:33,110
You took them from me.

228
00:26:33,520 --> 00:26:38,210
You are...

229
00:26:46,340 --> 00:26:48,910
No, I will take them both back.

230
00:26:49,440 --> 00:26:52,520
I will not leave them to you!
I will not leave them.

231
00:26:54,110 --> 00:26:55,590
I will get them both back!

232
00:26:56,060 --> 00:26:57,460
Sultan Mesut.

233
00:26:58,470 --> 00:26:59,650
They want you.

234
00:27:03,000 --> 00:27:04,430
They want you, my Sultan.

235
00:27:06,440 --> 00:27:07,530
I told you, Osman Bey.

236
00:27:08,460 --> 00:27:09,620
I am a mess.

237
00:27:10,650 --> 00:27:13,400
My wreck befalls
those who stand beside me.

238
00:27:13,960 --> 00:27:16,100
Even if you describe yourself
as a mess...

239
00:27:17,190 --> 00:27:18,190
I need you.

240
00:27:20,600 --> 00:27:22,130
I know İsmihan.

241
00:27:23,700 --> 00:27:24,700
And I know you too.

242
00:27:27,880 --> 00:27:30,640
And you will know me too, this
will be over.

243
00:27:31,660 --> 00:27:33,950
I will not give her either
my loved ones...

244
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:35,820
or you.

245
00:27:37,300 --> 00:27:40,170
So what are we going to do, Osman Bey?

246
00:27:43,000 --> 00:27:45,410
I will hide you in a place
where no one will know.

247
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:47,520
Aykut will know
where you're going.

248
00:27:47,580 --> 00:27:51,020
Your command, my Bey. I will take Sultan
to the safest place, Inshallah.

249
00:27:51,130 --> 00:27:52,130
Come on, my Sultan.

250
00:27:52,790 --> 00:27:56,190
My Bey!

251
00:27:59,290 --> 00:28:00,510
Konur is in
the dungeon.

252
00:28:01,090 --> 00:28:02,090
However, he is ill...

253
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:05,740
...and his disease is contagious.

254
00:28:06,120 --> 00:28:08,740
İsmihan clearly did this on purpose.

255
00:28:14,140 --> 00:28:15,420
And not just Konur.

256
00:28:16,360 --> 00:28:18,100
This disease is seen
in Söğüt too.

257
00:28:20,110 --> 00:28:21,390
The people are sick.

258
00:28:23,460 --> 00:28:25,020
The situation is dangerous.

259
00:28:29,150 --> 00:28:31,050
So that's why they left Söğüt...

260
00:28:33,960 --> 00:28:36,460
and made Marmaracık their headquarters.

261
00:28:37,210 --> 00:28:38,210
Tell me.

262
00:28:40,050 --> 00:28:41,050
Konur...

263
00:28:42,840 --> 00:28:43,840
Can we save him?

264
00:28:44,780 --> 00:28:46,370
We will do our best, my Bey.

265
00:28:47,480 --> 00:28:49,490
We will continue to pray for him.

266
00:28:52,270 --> 00:28:53,270
So...

267
00:28:55,160 --> 00:28:57,390
We will make Söğüt
our impenetrable fortress.

268
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:00,870
- Malhun.
- Yes, my Bey.

269
00:29:01,030 --> 00:29:03,450
Together with the Alps, you
will control Söğüt.

270
00:29:04,190 --> 00:29:09,580
Kumral Abdal, this disease won't spread
from here, you'll solve this problem.

271
00:29:12,710 --> 00:29:18,300
Malhun, do your best and keep the
disease away from Söğüt.

272
00:29:19,550 --> 00:29:20,920
Don't worry, my Bey.

273
00:29:22,570 --> 00:29:24,400
I'm going to take my
Sheikh and Bala.

274
00:29:24,460 --> 00:29:26,720
- Mal Allah save you.
- Thank you.

275
00:29:27,460 --> 00:29:28,460
Come on, Alps!

276
00:29:29,110 --> 00:29:30,930
Come on, come on.

277
00:29:35,990 --> 00:29:37,340
Sheikh Edebali.

278
00:29:39,550 --> 00:29:40,910
is in our dungeon.

279
00:29:42,460 --> 00:29:44,460
What are these days we live in, my Allah?

280
00:29:45,610 --> 00:29:50,390
What could we have done, we
couldn't say no to Mother Sultan.

281
00:29:52,840 --> 00:29:54,760
We had to.

282
00:29:55,270 --> 00:29:56,270
They won't stop.

283
00:29:57,650 --> 00:30:00,320
As long as Osman cannot stop
and no one stops him...

284
00:30:00,610 --> 00:30:03,000
...he will cause misfortune
to many people.

285
00:30:09,140 --> 00:30:10,380
Allah exists, Bengi.

286
00:30:12,840 --> 00:30:15,030
Sheikh Edebali is one of Allah's saints.

287
00:30:15,810 --> 00:30:19,170
Do you think they will be
successful, those who did this to him?

288
00:30:24,230 --> 00:30:25,630
We're on the wrong path.

289
00:30:27,660 --> 00:30:28,960
We're on the wrong path.

290
00:30:34,030 --> 00:30:35,890
Let Osman hear about this...

291
00:30:37,200 --> 00:30:39,340
and the castle will be
demolished over our heads.

292
00:30:40,560 --> 00:30:42,510
He can't destroy it, Öktem Bey.

293
00:30:43,880 --> 00:30:44,880
He can't destroy it.

294
00:30:50,820 --> 00:30:51,820
Mother Sultan.

295
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:57,190
The castle is under my rule.

296
00:30:58,200 --> 00:31:02,200
Who is Osman Bey to attack
the places I rule?

297
00:31:09,050 --> 00:31:10,050
My Sultan.

298
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:14,460
Sheikh Edebali is not only
important to Osman Bey.

299
00:31:15,540 --> 00:31:17,430
He is important for all Turks.

300
00:31:20,950 --> 00:31:21,950
He is Allah's saint.

301
00:31:24,380 --> 00:31:25,380
I'm afraid...

302
00:31:28,150 --> 00:31:29,670
Nothing to fear.

303
00:31:30,330 --> 00:31:31,330
Öktem Bey.

304
00:31:34,700 --> 00:31:36,170
I know what you know.

305
00:31:38,350 --> 00:31:40,990
May you also know what I know.

306
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:46,060
Osman hides Mesut.

307
00:31:49,490 --> 00:31:50,830
If he gives me Mesut...

308
00:31:52,290 --> 00:31:53,780
I will give him Sheikh Edebali.

309
00:31:55,160 --> 00:32:00,590
Is our state a state of infidels that we
can be hostile to Allah's saint?

310
00:32:06,340 --> 00:32:07,340
Now, tell me.

311
00:32:09,290 --> 00:32:15,120
Will you stand by Osman Bey, who rebelled
against the Seljuk state?

312
00:32:17,070 --> 00:32:18,070
Or will you stand by me?

313
00:32:24,820 --> 00:32:29,240
Of course, I will stand by you.

314
00:32:31,490 --> 00:32:32,490
And now...

315
00:32:34,450 --> 00:32:38,310
I will increase the measures
if you allow me.

316
00:33:03,060 --> 00:33:04,590
I trust you absolutely.

317
00:33:05,300 --> 00:33:06,300
Bengi Hatun.

318
00:33:08,850 --> 00:33:11,130
Thanks to you, we will have another guest.

319
00:33:15,080 --> 00:33:16,830
I have sent news to Bala Hatun.

320
00:33:18,240 --> 00:33:21,490
She will come here to save her father.

321
00:33:26,230 --> 00:33:27,230
She insulted me.

322
00:33:28,880 --> 00:33:30,270
She deceived me.

323
00:33:35,040 --> 00:33:37,250
Did you think I'd let her
go unpunished?

324
00:33:40,820 --> 00:33:41,820
Never.

325
00:33:44,100 --> 00:33:45,400
I forgive everything..

326
00:33:46,600 --> 00:33:50,330
but I do not forgive this.

327
00:33:53,500 --> 00:33:55,770
I'll make her regret, Bengi Hatun.

328
00:33:58,300 --> 00:34:00,680
I will punish her so hard that...

329
00:34:01,800 --> 00:34:09,080
everyone will be afraid to cross their
boundaries with me again.

330
00:34:14,219 --> 00:34:16,560
And what about Sheikh
Edebali, Mother Sultan?

331
00:34:19,810 --> 00:34:21,260
Are you going to let him go?

332
00:34:34,370 --> 00:34:37,429
Halime, my beautiful daughter.

333
00:34:44,960 --> 00:34:46,290
No.

334
00:34:47,889 --> 00:34:49,570
You will be
angry with your mother.

335
00:34:49,650 --> 00:34:53,800
I know you will be upset, but
don't be upset or angry

336
00:34:55,020 --> 00:34:56,320
I'll go now but I...

337
00:34:57,670 --> 00:34:59,780
I won't worry.

338
00:35:13,820 --> 00:35:14,820
Mother.

339
00:35:16,100 --> 00:35:17,100
What is happening?

340
00:35:19,180 --> 00:35:20,310
Is there bad news?

341
00:35:22,770 --> 00:35:25,550
- My sheikh?
- No, son, no.

342
00:35:26,710 --> 00:35:28,130
Come on, come, sit down.

343
00:35:30,560 --> 00:35:32,400
Your father summoned me to Söğüt.

344
00:35:33,010 --> 00:35:35,520
You will take care of your sister, right?

345
00:35:36,200 --> 00:35:37,200
She is so young.

346
00:35:38,520 --> 00:35:40,070
Take good care of her.

347
00:35:41,370 --> 00:35:44,030
Take care of her until l I come back.

348
00:35:44,870 --> 00:35:48,970
I entrust you to Alla and
entrust you to each other.

349
00:35:59,330 --> 00:36:00,740
Don't worry, mother.

350
00:36:03,370 --> 00:36:04,370
Halime.

351
00:36:09,960 --> 00:36:10,960
Let's go.

352
00:37:08,870 --> 00:37:10,630
Forgive me, Osman.

353
00:37:11,150 --> 00:37:12,830
Forgive me.

354
00:37:14,710 --> 00:37:18,170
Tell Osman and my children..

355
00:37:20,400 --> 00:37:22,610
that Bala loves them more than her soul.

356
00:37:26,260 --> 00:37:28,060
Come on, go, girl.

357
00:37:29,230 --> 00:37:30,470
Let's go.

358
00:38:28,500 --> 00:38:30,530
Let us go from this direction, Sultan.

359
00:38:30,620 --> 00:38:34,890
Let us go and see, Aykut Alp, how
far we can go?

360
00:38:46,270 --> 00:38:49,290
Yenişehir/Osman Bey's Palace

361
00:38:54,760 --> 00:38:58,040
I shouldn't have left my
mother alone, I'm late.

362
00:39:01,640 --> 00:39:03,070
Aladdin.

363
00:39:08,910 --> 00:39:11,560
- Where are you going?
- I'll go to my mother.

364
00:39:12,380 --> 00:39:14,530
I will not go back without
taking my mother.

365
00:39:20,130 --> 00:39:21,920
This is not possible, my brother.

366
00:39:24,130 --> 00:39:26,530
We cannot move without
an order from my Bey.

367
00:39:27,420 --> 00:39:33,970
Halime will search for you, will you leave
her alone in the absence of your mother?

368
00:39:34,720 --> 00:39:37,310
What's your use then, Ülgen Hatun?

369
00:39:37,600 --> 00:39:42,060
What if something happened to my mother,
what would I tell my sister then?

370
00:39:42,510 --> 00:39:46,880
When she grows up, won't she tell me why
did I leave my mother alone?

371
00:39:47,070 --> 00:39:50,590
What will I say when she tells me "Why
didn't you prevent her from going?"

372
00:39:50,700 --> 00:39:52,120
Tell me, what will I say?

373
00:39:52,410 --> 00:39:56,820
Am I going to tell her I just sat
doing nothing, what am I going to say?

374
00:40:02,770 --> 00:40:03,840
Aladdin.

375
00:40:06,060 --> 00:40:07,270
Look, brother.

376
00:40:09,800 --> 00:40:12,010
We now have the biggest duties.

377
00:40:13,060 --> 00:40:14,650
Especially your duty.

378
00:40:15,140 --> 00:40:17,930
We will not move without an
order from Osman Bey.

379
00:40:18,580 --> 00:40:20,820
He must guide us to the right path.

380
00:40:57,540 --> 00:40:59,240
İsmihan Sultan.

381
00:41:00,200 --> 00:41:03,110
Come out.

382
00:41:15,380 --> 00:41:17,050
Bala Hatun.

383
00:41:19,940 --> 00:41:21,490
You came.

384
00:41:24,080 --> 00:41:25,660
You seem to be in a hurry.

385
00:41:26,680 --> 00:41:29,580
I have come and here I am before you.

386
00:41:35,690 --> 00:41:37,570
Leave my father now.

387
00:41:42,480 --> 00:41:44,020
Leave your father?

388
00:41:49,350 --> 00:41:53,440
His time will come, Bala Hatun, be
patient a little.

389
00:41:55,630 --> 00:41:58,530
Your problem is with me, and here I am.

390
00:41:58,960 --> 00:42:00,410
Leave my father, then.

391
00:42:00,610 --> 00:42:03,920
Yes, my problem is with you.

392
00:42:04,670 --> 00:42:07,430
You've crossed the line with what you've done.

393
00:42:08,470 --> 00:42:10,260
You deserved a lesson.

394
00:42:10,550 --> 00:42:13,150
Soldiers, arrest her!

395
00:42:19,210 --> 00:42:22,410
Let me go! Will you give
me a lesson, İsmihan?

396
00:42:23,190 --> 00:42:24,870
You are a coward.

397
00:42:25,510 --> 00:42:29,060
You're so helpless that you couldn't
come out to me on your own.

398
00:42:29,530 --> 00:42:35,600
- You...
- You confuse courage with stupidity.

399
00:42:38,640 --> 00:42:40,090
You are not brave.

400
00:42:41,010 --> 00:42:44,140
You've surrendered.

401
00:42:44,370 --> 00:42:45,710
Is this courage?

402
00:42:45,800 --> 00:42:50,290
You don't seem to know anything
about courage, love and fidelity.

403
00:42:50,970 --> 00:42:54,150
- You'll die without knowing this, İsmihan.
- You impudent one.

404
00:42:54,190 --> 00:42:55,450
Bala Hatun.

405
00:42:56,470 --> 00:42:58,020
Alçiçek.

406
00:43:01,600 --> 00:43:05,210
You played a game on me.

407
00:43:06,500 --> 00:43:09,690
You put your hand on what belongs to me.

408
00:43:10,890 --> 00:43:13,470
Did you think this would go
unpunished?

409
00:43:15,160 --> 00:43:19,550
You thought you could sow the seeds
of discord between us, but you were wrong.

410
00:43:20,630 --> 00:43:23,670
However, your evil games didn't
separate us, and now you...

411
00:43:23,770 --> 00:43:24,850
Bala.

412
00:43:26,450 --> 00:43:30,200
İsmihan! Now, go outside!

413
00:43:30,800 --> 00:43:32,000
Osman.

414
00:43:33,160 --> 00:43:34,530
Bala.

415
00:43:39,440 --> 00:43:40,480
Bala.

416
00:43:41,280 --> 00:43:45,130
İsmihan! Go outside if you have
the courage to do so.

417
00:43:53,700 --> 00:43:55,110
Take her to the dungeon.

418
00:43:55,290 --> 00:43:58,340
Osman, let me go!
Osman!

419
00:43:58,800 --> 00:43:59,860
Bala.

420
00:44:00,200 --> 00:44:02,650
Osman!

421
00:44:03,050 --> 00:44:05,790
Osman! Leave me alone!

422
00:44:06,210 --> 00:44:07,270
Bala.

423
00:44:07,910 --> 00:44:09,250
Get out!

424
00:44:09,880 --> 00:44:11,670
Leave me!

425
00:44:13,180 --> 00:44:14,260
Where?

426
00:44:16,420 --> 00:44:17,500
Bala.

427
00:44:18,090 --> 00:44:21,490
İsmihan! Go outside!

428
00:44:24,070 --> 00:44:25,360
Get out!

429
00:44:30,080 --> 00:44:34,790
Osman! This is the truth
you do not understand.

430
00:44:35,410 --> 00:44:38,450
You are at the bottom and I am at the top.

431
00:44:38,920 --> 00:44:41,960
You are defeated and I am victorious.

432
00:44:42,790 --> 00:44:47,830
I swear I'll blow this
place over your head.

433
00:44:48,450 --> 00:44:51,380
I'll burn this summit on which
you are sitting to the ground.

434
00:44:52,520 --> 00:44:57,100
You won't be able to do anything while
your Sheikh and wife are my captives.

435
00:44:58,000 --> 00:44:59,570
Don't waste your breath.

436
00:45:00,060 --> 00:45:04,120
Even if it's my last breath, I'll take
them from your hands.

437
00:45:05,280 --> 00:45:06,680
This is easy.

438
00:45:07,510 --> 00:45:11,700
If you bring Mesut to me, I
will set them free.

439
00:45:12,120 --> 00:45:13,150
It's like that.

440
00:45:13,930 --> 00:45:18,230
I won't give you those who took refuge in
me and I won't leave my loved ones with you.

441
00:45:18,540 --> 00:45:19,970
Wake up, Osman!

442
00:45:20,330 --> 00:45:23,670
This is power.

443
00:45:24,170 --> 00:45:27,000
You no longer have any
judgment over the border areas.

444
00:45:28,900 --> 00:45:32,050
Resistance will only bring blood.

445
00:45:32,370 --> 00:45:34,940
As for
surrendering, it requires sacrifice.

446
00:45:35,710 --> 00:45:40,980
We give our heads and souls, but
we never give up!

447
00:45:44,860 --> 00:45:50,960
You and those behind you should know
that I'll make this place a grave for you.

448
00:45:52,310 --> 00:45:55,995
If you bring one catapult
to these walls...

449
00:45:56,025 --> 00:45:59,705
you'll be the one who beheads
your Sheikh and your wife.

450
00:46:00,010 --> 00:46:04,020
You have time
until tomorrow evening Osman.

451
00:46:04,950 --> 00:46:08,370
If Mesut doesn't
come by tomorrow evening...

452
00:46:09,380 --> 00:46:13,090
dig two graves for your
Sheikh and for your wife.

453
00:46:14,850 --> 00:46:17,000
Only what Allah wants will happen.

454
00:46:18,190 --> 00:46:19,920
Only what Allah wants will happen.

455
00:46:20,190 --> 00:46:21,070
Let's go.

456
00:46:43,470 --> 00:46:45,680
Send the men to the nearby places...

457
00:46:46,470 --> 00:46:49,750
to collect all the supplies
that are there.

458
00:46:50,970 --> 00:46:53,890
Tonight, we will prepare a wonderful dinner.

459
00:47:02,520 --> 00:47:04,230
My lover.

460
00:47:11,150 --> 00:47:12,460
Olof.

461
00:47:23,650 --> 00:47:27,780
What did you do?

462
00:47:31,450 --> 00:47:34,420
I have decided to fight for
the religion of Jesus.

463
00:47:42,590 --> 00:47:44,650
How do you betray Odin?

464
00:47:48,230 --> 00:47:50,420
Odin will curse us.

465
00:47:50,790 --> 00:47:53,110
The black curse will always
follow us!

466
00:47:53,270 --> 00:47:55,790
No, Frigg, it's over.

467
00:47:57,120 --> 00:47:59,690
The religion of Jesus
has given me an army!

468
00:48:00,040 --> 00:48:01,740
What did Odin give me?

469
00:48:01,920 --> 00:48:06,520
Olof! The souls of the warriors in
Valhalla are with us.

470
00:48:07,260 --> 00:48:10,690
Odin has sent them to take revenge.

471
00:48:12,620 --> 00:48:17,160
As Odin turned his back on
me, Jesus' religion embraced me.

472
00:48:17,730 --> 00:48:21,970
Besides, I have not seen any
soul kill an enemy for us.

473
00:48:23,270 --> 00:48:24,380
Let me!

474
00:48:26,080 --> 00:48:27,830
Are these the warriors?

475
00:48:28,670 --> 00:48:31,100
Which one would
sacrifice his life for you?

476
00:48:33,650 --> 00:48:35,900
Do not underestimate the army of Jesus.

477
00:48:36,420 --> 00:48:39,920
We shall take the lands, upon which
we shall live, with these men.

478
00:48:41,200 --> 00:48:43,040
Everything is prepared for us.

479
00:48:45,080 --> 00:48:47,120
It's all set for us, Frigg.

480
00:48:47,390 --> 00:48:48,520
For us?

481
00:48:49,560 --> 00:48:50,720
For us?

482
00:48:54,010 --> 00:48:55,660
Kantakuzenos' dog!

483
00:48:58,150 --> 00:48:59,420
That is enough.

484
00:48:59,540 --> 00:49:00,780
That's enough, Frigg.

485
00:49:01,450 --> 00:49:02,800
That's enough.

486
00:49:07,150 --> 00:49:08,680
Olof.

487
00:49:10,270 --> 00:49:12,020
What are we doing?

488
00:49:13,340 --> 00:49:15,310
What are we doing
here?

489
00:49:15,560 --> 00:49:19,210
Territory and revenge.

490
00:49:26,300 --> 00:49:30,080
I am the one who will
grant you this revenge.

491
00:49:31,190 --> 00:49:34,880
I didn't love you for Odin's sake.

492
00:49:51,860 --> 00:49:54,240
İsmihan wants you by her
side in Marmaracık.

493
00:49:57,980 --> 00:50:00,260
She will take everything
he owns from Osman.

494
00:50:02,690 --> 00:50:03,740
Even his soul.

495
00:50:11,460 --> 00:50:13,040
How good news!

496
00:50:21,810 --> 00:50:23,580
"Allah Almighty speaks the truth."

497
00:50:55,300 --> 00:50:56,300
Don't cry, sister.

498
00:50:57,380 --> 00:50:58,500
Mother will come.

499
00:50:58,550 --> 00:50:59,570
She will come.

500
00:51:00,530 --> 00:51:02,030
My heart is being torn.

501
00:51:03,100 --> 00:51:03,810
Don't cry.

502
00:51:08,920 --> 00:51:10,020
My Allah.

503
00:51:10,590 --> 00:51:12,910
You care for the helpless...

504
00:51:13,360 --> 00:51:15,310
and heal them.

505
00:51:15,950 --> 00:51:20,140
Bring us together with my mother and
grandfather, my Allah.

506
00:51:21,220 --> 00:51:22,740
Help us, my Allah.

507
00:51:23,900 --> 00:51:25,395
You are the ruler.

508
00:51:25,570 --> 00:51:26,960
You are the Malik.

509
00:51:27,580 --> 00:51:29,940
For my sister who is
crying in her cradle...

510
00:51:29,960 --> 00:51:32,830
and for the sanctity of our Prophet, the
Messenger of Allah...

511
00:51:32,850 --> 00:51:35,570
do not test us by losing
our mother, my Allah.

512
00:51:45,490 --> 00:51:46,320
Open.

513
00:51:56,770 --> 00:51:58,860
Don't touch me!

514
00:51:59,260 --> 00:52:00,140
Bala!

515
00:52:00,830 --> 00:52:02,780
I'll go myself, don't touch me!

516
00:52:02,780 --> 00:52:03,740
Remove your hand!

517
00:52:04,350 --> 00:52:05,740
My dear.

518
00:52:06,580 --> 00:52:07,420
My father!

519
00:52:07,900 --> 00:52:09,420
- Bala.
- Father!

520
00:52:10,870 --> 00:52:12,020
Leave me!

521
00:52:12,050 --> 00:52:13,260
Don't touch my daughter!

522
00:52:13,480 --> 00:52:15,070
- My father.
- My dear.

523
00:52:15,630 --> 00:52:16,650
Leave her.

524
00:52:16,820 --> 00:52:19,120
Leave my daughter!
Leave her!

525
00:52:19,380 --> 00:52:19,980
Father.

526
00:52:21,540 --> 00:52:22,770
My dear.

527
00:52:22,930 --> 00:52:24,770
What did they do
to you like that?

528
00:52:24,940 --> 00:52:25,790
My Father!

529
00:52:28,410 --> 00:52:29,750
I have come, my
Sheikh, I am here.

530
00:52:29,780 --> 00:52:31,480
Don't touch me!

531
00:52:34,260 --> 00:52:35,070
My father.

532
00:52:39,920 --> 00:52:41,820
What are you doing here?

533
00:52:42,100 --> 00:52:42,960
Dear Bala.

534
00:52:43,260 --> 00:52:45,140
She said she's going to kill you, father.

535
00:52:45,180 --> 00:52:46,900
What could I do?

536
00:52:49,630 --> 00:52:52,180
Martyrdom is a meeting
point for us, my daughter.

537
00:52:53,500 --> 00:52:56,740
If it exists in our destiny, we have it.

538
00:52:57,630 --> 00:52:58,740
Otherwise..

539
00:52:59,760 --> 00:53:03,100
We will miss our Allah for a long time.

540
00:53:07,870 --> 00:53:08,750
My Father.

541
00:53:16,140 --> 00:53:18,940
İsmihan handcuffed us.

542
00:53:20,850 --> 00:53:23,330
She plunged her dagger into
our warm body...

543
00:53:24,620 --> 00:53:26,930
moved it slowly.

544
00:53:30,000 --> 00:53:32,270
What do you think a
wounded wolf might do?

545
00:53:33,070 --> 00:53:34,460
Pounce and attack, my Bey.

546
00:53:35,070 --> 00:53:36,240
Exactly.

547
00:53:37,020 --> 00:53:38,660
We will never stop

548
00:53:40,800 --> 00:53:41,650
My Bey.

549
00:53:42,640 --> 00:53:46,770
She said if I saw a specter of artillery
before the walls, I would kill them both.

550
00:53:49,180 --> 00:53:51,280
Even though we don't have cannons...

551
00:53:52,640 --> 00:53:54,580
We will get through this, Inshallah.

552
00:53:55,340 --> 00:53:57,150
But it is difficult, my Bey.

553
00:53:57,650 --> 00:53:59,810
If we can't get over it...

554
00:54:01,230 --> 00:54:03,360
Then, we will find another solution.

555
00:54:06,290 --> 00:54:08,260
But we will not give up.

556
00:54:09,580 --> 00:54:11,620
We will never think of giving up.

557
00:54:11,700 --> 00:54:13,140
Tell us hit so we hit!

558
00:54:13,170 --> 00:54:15,100
Tell us die and
we will die, my Bey!

559
00:54:15,330 --> 00:54:16,580
What are we going to do?

560
00:54:19,580 --> 00:54:22,020
We will rapidly increase
the number of Alps.

561
00:54:23,020 --> 00:54:24,790
Bring shovels.

562
00:54:24,830 --> 00:54:26,830
We'll start digging a tunnel.

563
00:54:29,600 --> 00:54:32,140
We will enter the corridors
inside the wall.

564
00:54:33,840 --> 00:54:37,740
We will keep digging as much as we can.

565
00:54:39,200 --> 00:54:40,610
Before sunrise...

566
00:54:42,270 --> 00:54:44,140
We will end this, Inshallah.

567
00:54:47,170 --> 00:54:49,970
We will attack them at the
moment they least expect...

568
00:54:51,980 --> 00:54:54,500
and from a place they would never expect.

569
00:54:56,560 --> 00:54:57,940
But don't forget.

570
00:54:59,170 --> 00:55:00,600
This is not a fight.

571
00:55:00,610 --> 00:55:02,610
It is a rescue campaign.

572
00:55:04,140 --> 00:55:05,470
After we entered...

573
00:55:05,730 --> 00:55:07,360
we will go to the dungeon.

574
00:55:09,060 --> 00:55:11,440
We will take Bala Hatun and
Sheikh Edebali.

575
00:55:12,190 --> 00:55:13,370
- Boran.
- My Bey.

576
00:55:13,410 --> 00:55:15,730
You will go with the Alps who are
behind you to the gate of the house.

577
00:55:15,760 --> 00:55:18,130
There will be Alps at the gate as well.

578
00:55:18,180 --> 00:55:22,060
After all the prisoners are
released from the dungeon....

579
00:55:24,480 --> 00:55:26,530
We will kill
everyone who's there then.

580
00:55:27,600 --> 00:55:29,180
Your command, my Bey.

581
00:55:29,390 --> 00:55:30,720
Your command, my Bey.

582
00:55:44,210 --> 00:55:44,990
My Bey.

583
00:55:45,570 --> 00:55:47,100
There is news from Konya.

584
00:55:47,860 --> 00:55:49,100
Sultan Aladdin.

585
00:55:49,520 --> 00:55:52,500
He's coming here with a huge army.

586
00:56:04,670 --> 00:56:06,460
We'll finish digging tonight

587
00:56:07,220 --> 00:56:10,150
We will have entered the castle
before the Sultan arrives.

588
00:56:10,370 --> 00:56:11,630
We don't have much time.

589
00:56:12,430 --> 00:56:13,810
We are running out of time.

590
00:56:14,140 --> 00:56:15,100
Come on, Boran.

591
00:56:22,290 --> 00:56:23,900
Let's see.

592
00:56:43,790 --> 00:56:45,240
Hurry up.

593
00:56:45,250 --> 00:56:47,250
Bengi and Öktem shouldn't see you.

594
00:56:47,280 --> 00:56:49,280
Their time will come, too

595
00:56:49,620 --> 00:56:51,280
But, Osman first.

596
00:56:52,180 --> 00:56:53,280
Follow me.

597
00:57:04,990 --> 00:57:05,840
Marta.

598
00:57:16,370 --> 00:57:17,330
Bengi Hatun.

599
00:57:22,020 --> 00:57:23,820
Did Mother Sultan summon you?

600
00:57:24,190 --> 00:57:25,040
Yes.

601
00:57:38,220 --> 00:57:39,790
Did you bring the fabrics again?

602
00:57:42,190 --> 00:57:42,990
Yes.

603
00:57:44,300 --> 00:57:45,830
But we're a little late.

604
00:57:45,870 --> 00:57:47,820
Excuse me, Bengi Hatun.

605
00:57:47,870 --> 00:57:49,870
Let's not keep Mother Sultan
waiting.

606
00:58:12,610 --> 00:58:14,300
It causes deep wounds.

607
00:58:14,470 --> 00:58:16,190
It causes a fever.

608
00:58:16,300 --> 00:58:19,260
Loss of consciousness
and slowed breathing.

609
00:58:24,800 --> 00:58:28,750
As if they had mixed the poison of snakes with the poison of scorpions and the poisonous hemlock plant...

610
00:58:28,860 --> 00:58:30,580
...and they injected
him.

611
00:58:31,460 --> 00:58:34,610
I also have never seen anything like
this before, Kumral Abdal.

612
00:58:34,750 --> 00:58:36,190
It's like a plague...

613
00:58:36,240 --> 00:58:37,680
but it is not.

614
00:58:37,870 --> 00:58:40,580
It's not like that.
It's a different matter.

615
00:58:50,450 --> 00:58:52,540
Not something I've ever seen.

616
00:58:53,090 --> 00:58:55,490
Whoever caused this is
not from these lands.

617
00:58:57,310 --> 00:58:59,300
Obviously he's been
like this for days.

618
00:58:59,380 --> 00:59:01,440
What a strange effect.

619
00:59:01,890 --> 00:59:03,760
It's slowly taking over everywhere.

620
00:59:03,820 --> 00:59:05,470
Not only him...

621
00:59:05,560 --> 00:59:07,560
It infected everyone in Söğüt.

622
00:59:08,160 --> 00:59:10,860
If we don't find a cure for it, woe
to us, Ayşe Hatun.

623
00:59:11,300 --> 00:59:13,900
We will bury our heroes one by one.

624
00:59:15,060 --> 00:59:16,050
Kumral Abdal.

625
00:59:16,900 --> 00:59:18,350
May Allah protect us.

626
00:59:18,400 --> 00:59:20,400
You will find a cure.

627
00:59:22,130 --> 00:59:23,410
You'll find, right?

628
00:59:29,580 --> 00:59:32,200
The medicine is hidden
in the poison, Ayşe Hatun.

629
00:59:35,350 --> 00:59:36,290
My valiant.

630
00:59:36,320 --> 00:59:39,550
Get me a hemlock and a snake, but let
it be a poisonous snake...

631
00:59:39,570 --> 00:59:40,820
and a scorpion.

632
00:59:41,390 --> 00:59:43,840
Come on, our time is running out.
Come on.

633
00:59:44,110 --> 00:59:45,460
Your command, Kumral Abdal.

634
00:59:45,490 --> 00:59:46,730
Let's go.

635
01:00:01,920 --> 01:00:03,090
Osman Bey.

636
01:00:05,740 --> 01:00:07,140
I heard what happened.

637
01:00:07,380 --> 01:00:08,500
Alps are ready.

638
01:00:08,590 --> 01:00:10,790
I will transfer those in
the tribe to İnegöl.

639
01:00:10,800 --> 01:00:12,760
We are ready to hit Marmaracık.

640
01:00:13,330 --> 01:00:14,590
There is no hitting.

641
01:00:16,160 --> 01:00:17,380
So what do we do?

642
01:00:18,820 --> 01:00:20,340
I will enter Marmaracık.

643
01:00:21,010 --> 01:00:23,800
And I will take back
my wife and my Sheikh.

644
01:00:24,620 --> 01:00:26,610
However, your duty will be different.

645
01:00:27,980 --> 01:00:28,740
Tell me.

646
01:00:30,750 --> 01:00:34,130
The Sultan has gathered a large army
and is heading towards us.

647
01:00:35,790 --> 01:00:37,500
You will stop it.

648
01:00:39,440 --> 01:00:40,670
How many?

649
01:00:41,730 --> 01:00:44,100
We can block them on the way
with some traps.

650
01:00:44,530 --> 01:00:46,240
But we'll have to hit them later.

651
01:00:50,210 --> 01:00:52,420
Are you going to hit
Sultan because I asked for this?

652
01:00:54,580 --> 01:00:56,640
How do we stop otherwise?

653
01:00:59,330 --> 01:01:01,860
Sultan is coming to see İsmihan
in Marmaracık.

654
01:01:02,450 --> 01:01:04,240
You will meet them on the way.

655
01:01:05,180 --> 01:01:07,900
You will make them change
their way to Söğüt.

656
01:01:09,810 --> 01:01:11,700
We will host them there.

657
01:01:14,640 --> 01:01:16,360
Be careful.

658
01:01:18,830 --> 01:01:21,550
Marmaracık Castle

659
01:01:42,620 --> 01:01:45,940
You will be held accountable for
everything you have done, İsmihan.

660
01:01:50,670 --> 01:01:54,290
The day will come when you
will be held accountable.

661
01:01:55,460 --> 01:01:58,150
It is you who must be held
accountable, Bala Hatun.

662
01:02:00,030 --> 01:02:01,410
You raised the dagger at me.

663
01:02:02,010 --> 01:02:04,730
You poisoned me and stole my seal.

664
01:02:05,380 --> 01:02:07,940
You laid your hands on my
ancestral estate, Söğüt.

665
01:02:08,260 --> 01:02:09,940
Do you accuse me of stealing?

666
01:02:12,660 --> 01:02:16,190
I didn't just get your
ancestors' possessions...

667
01:02:16,540 --> 01:02:17,690
I got your father, too.

668
01:02:22,420 --> 01:02:24,240
Osman will bring Mesut.

669
01:02:25,140 --> 01:02:26,240
And then...

670
01:02:26,480 --> 01:02:29,220
...it will be your end.

671
01:02:32,380 --> 01:02:36,770
You are so arrogant that you think you
know the time of my life and my death.

672
01:02:37,700 --> 01:02:40,260
Death is in the hands of Allah.

673
01:02:41,460 --> 01:02:46,700
We live as determined by fate.

674
01:02:48,200 --> 01:02:50,730
But who knows?

675
01:02:51,520 --> 01:02:56,310
Your life may be shorter.

676
01:02:57,820 --> 01:03:00,400
Do you know what is short, Sheikh Edebali?

677
01:03:00,910 --> 01:03:03,050
Your dream of establishing a state.

678
01:03:03,610 --> 01:03:05,380
That dream was born dead!

679
01:03:05,590 --> 01:03:08,160
You don't know that!

680
01:03:08,900 --> 01:03:10,790
Even if you have power to kill us...

681
01:03:11,260 --> 01:03:13,210
That dream will live forever!

682
01:03:13,870 --> 01:03:15,980
How many of us can you take down,
Ismihan?

683
01:03:16,090 --> 01:03:19,330
How many of us can you kill?
How many of us can you kill?

684
01:03:22,240 --> 01:03:23,270
One of you.

685
01:03:24,890 --> 01:03:25,890
Thousand of you.

686
01:03:28,220 --> 01:03:29,630
Ten thousands of you!

687
01:03:32,140 --> 01:03:35,300
Whoever dreams of establishing
a state over a state!

688
01:03:36,150 --> 01:03:37,650
There is no free country!

689
01:03:38,100 --> 01:03:41,990
You handed over your state
to the Mongols for power!

690
01:03:44,250 --> 01:03:46,480
Everyone wants power, Bala Hatun.

691
01:03:48,710 --> 01:03:50,340
This is what you don't see.

692
01:03:51,560 --> 01:03:54,550
And for this, I ally with enemies
if necessary!

693
01:03:55,760 --> 01:03:57,510
...and I can sacrifice my people!

694
01:04:02,280 --> 01:04:04,760
You can't be as brave as I am.

695
01:04:07,320 --> 01:04:10,740
You can't take as much risk as I do.

696
01:04:12,790 --> 01:04:13,900
Of course I can't.

697
01:04:15,590 --> 01:04:17,610
There is death, Ismihan, death.

698
01:04:19,320 --> 01:04:21,750
You can get what you want
in this world today...

699
01:04:22,670 --> 01:04:24,420
But there's afterlife in Allah's presence.

700
01:04:29,790 --> 01:04:30,970
Do not worry.

701
01:04:34,680 --> 01:04:36,420
I will put you in the grave soon.

702
01:04:39,910 --> 01:04:41,960
We are not afraid of death, Ismihan!

703
01:04:43,050 --> 01:04:45,280
Death is not the end.

704
01:04:47,300 --> 01:04:52,120
It is clear that this world has deceived you,
and has forgotten it.

705
01:04:59,730 --> 01:05:01,990
Sheikh Edebali, the greatness!

706
01:05:12,760 --> 01:05:15,780
You love to talk about arragonce.

707
01:05:18,810 --> 01:05:22,990
You see yourselves so great...

708
01:05:24,070 --> 01:05:28,720
...so great that you try playing
a game on me, on the Mother Sultan.

709
01:05:33,690 --> 01:05:35,120
This is not your level.

710
01:05:36,380 --> 01:05:38,100
What we have is not arrogance.

711
01:05:39,080 --> 01:05:40,220
It's courage.

712
01:05:42,340 --> 01:05:45,000
It should be in the heart of every Muslim.

713
01:05:46,290 --> 01:05:49,310
Whether by games or weapons.

714
01:05:50,740 --> 01:05:53,070
We are not afraid to object you.

715
01:05:58,890 --> 01:06:03,040
Look around, sheikh Edebali.

716
01:06:04,480 --> 01:06:05,570
You are in prison.

717
01:06:07,430 --> 01:06:08,470
Ah.

718
01:06:10,060 --> 01:06:12,200
Because you put us in jail...

719
01:06:13,520 --> 01:06:15,940
...you count that as a win, right?

720
01:06:17,930 --> 01:06:19,100
So listen carefully.

721
01:06:20,750 --> 01:06:24,230
Prison is like a prophet's place!

722
01:06:26,770 --> 01:06:29,210
Falling into the well which Joseph fell...

723
01:06:30,180 --> 01:06:31,720
This is glory to us!

724
01:06:32,570 --> 01:06:34,150
But Ismihan Hatun.

725
01:06:35,630 --> 01:06:40,480
What you do is identical to the
Pharaoh's actions.

726
01:06:42,660 --> 01:06:45,130
Wait for the time when
you will become humiliated.

727
01:06:46,050 --> 01:06:49,740
When that time comes,
you will be shattered.

728
01:06:53,600 --> 01:06:57,020
Whether by games or weapons.

729
01:07:08,360 --> 01:07:09,400
My Bey!

730
01:07:09,580 --> 01:07:11,530
- Come on.
- Oh Allah.

731
01:07:12,100 --> 01:07:13,480
O Allah.

732
01:07:19,420 --> 01:07:21,790
Come on, Cerkutay, we don't have much time

733
01:07:22,610 --> 01:07:23,690
Hurry up a bit!

734
01:07:26,810 --> 01:07:27,930
Brother.

735
01:07:28,190 --> 01:07:31,960
We still have a long way to the passage
you mentioned, right Shamil?

736
01:07:33,860 --> 01:07:36,710
Your knowledge of all those passages...

737
01:07:37,290 --> 01:07:39,470
...will be our way out, Inshallah.

738
01:07:39,920 --> 01:07:40,950
Hah?

739
01:07:40,995 --> 01:07:44,285
We are getting close, my Bey.

740
01:07:44,740 --> 01:07:47,610
A bit more digging and we will
see the passage, Inshallah.

741
01:07:47,610 --> 01:07:48,620
We're nearly there.

742
01:07:48,720 --> 01:07:51,620
We will enter the castle
and strike the infidels!

743
01:07:52,050 --> 01:07:53,140
Inshallah.

744
01:07:54,920 --> 01:07:57,260
Come on, Cerkutay.
Rest a little.

745
01:07:57,650 --> 01:07:58,980
Come on, let's swap places.

746
01:08:00,370 --> 01:08:01,650
Give me, come on.

747
01:08:02,690 --> 01:08:04,460
Gurbuz!
Come Gurbuz!

748
01:08:15,189 --> 01:08:17,149
Let's see, in the name of Allah!

749
01:08:18,720 --> 01:08:20,600
Come on, alps, don't stay idle!

750
01:08:20,880 --> 01:08:21,930
Come on!

751
01:08:23,660 --> 01:08:24,870
Allah!

752
01:08:26,590 --> 01:08:28,170
Gurbuz, stronger, Gurbuz!

753
01:08:30,220 --> 01:08:34,210
Hang on a little more, a little more!
My sheik, my Bala!

754
01:08:35,490 --> 01:08:39,120
How sure you are that you are right!

755
01:08:42,270 --> 01:08:46,040
What put you there is
Osman's desire of power!

756
01:08:47,069 --> 01:08:48,170
Not me.

757
01:08:48,950 --> 01:08:50,710
You accuse me of being cruel!

758
01:08:52,170 --> 01:08:54,850
But who pushed me to this is you.

759
01:08:57,810 --> 01:09:01,390
Your rebellion! Your games!

760
01:09:03,060 --> 01:09:04,870
If you want to be cruel...

761
01:09:06,640 --> 01:09:08,109
...you can find many excuses.

762
01:09:09,020 --> 01:09:14,859
One who was born cruel
can be cruel no matter what.

763
01:09:16,090 --> 01:09:19,500
I see it in your eyes, Ismihan.

764
01:09:21,270 --> 01:09:22,380
You are afraid.

765
01:09:23,399 --> 01:09:28,760
You are afraid of your end both
in this world and in afterlife.

766
01:09:30,189 --> 01:09:31,490
You shall fear, Ismihan.

767
01:09:33,920 --> 01:09:34,950
You shall fear.

768
01:09:36,149 --> 01:09:39,290
Your eyes are the mirror of my eyes.

769
01:09:41,399 --> 01:09:45,520
The fear you see in my eyes
is your own fear.

770
01:09:46,710 --> 01:09:49,029
Not mine, Sheik Edebali.

771
01:09:51,050 --> 01:09:54,820
The day you became with Osman
and betrayed Konya...

772
01:09:56,150 --> 01:09:57,430
...your sheikdom ended.

773
01:09:59,610 --> 01:10:02,400
So don't tire yourself up in vain.

774
01:10:05,580 --> 01:10:06,670
Now...

775
01:10:11,070 --> 01:10:14,170
I wish I could stay here and
talk to you more.

776
01:10:15,210 --> 01:10:16,270
But...

777
01:10:17,770 --> 01:10:19,270
...I have to welcome Osman.

778
01:10:34,530 --> 01:10:36,940
Father, they'll hurt Osman!

779
01:10:38,040 --> 01:10:40,770
Nothing happens unless Allah wills,
my daughter

780
01:10:42,020 --> 01:10:45,640
He is the best of ambushers.

781
01:10:46,320 --> 01:10:49,280
Their deception will be answered.

782
01:10:49,990 --> 01:10:52,160
My sheikh, my father!

783
01:10:52,680 --> 01:10:54,040
You're grieving too, I know that.

784
01:10:55,320 --> 01:10:57,190
You say this to calm me down.

785
01:10:58,670 --> 01:11:02,330
Aren't your tears for Osman Bey?

786
01:11:04,810 --> 01:11:05,720
Look.

787
01:11:07,110 --> 01:11:09,770
Ismihan united with infidels...

788
01:11:10,280 --> 01:11:13,010
...and stives to harm her Muslim
sisters and brothers.

789
01:11:14,110 --> 01:11:18,270
My tears are for the Islamic world
which is cut into pieces, my daughter.

790
01:11:19,780 --> 01:11:21,840
Both Osman Bey's heart and strength...

791
01:11:23,080 --> 01:11:25,330
...is able to overcome them.

792
01:11:26,230 --> 01:11:34,540
But who will unite these Muslims like
Ismihan, who are blinded by their greed?

793
01:11:35,940 --> 01:11:36,800
I think of this.

794
01:11:38,510 --> 01:11:39,960
I cry for this, my daughter.

795
01:11:41,630 --> 01:11:45,670
Humans break each other's hearts
for a temporary throne in this world.

796
01:11:46,470 --> 01:11:50,440
The eyes of Muslims are
covered with dust and smoke.

797
01:11:51,410 --> 01:11:55,160
How can you be a Muslim
by breaking others' hearts?

798
01:11:55,970 --> 01:11:57,690
What Islam is this?

799
01:11:58,980 --> 01:12:02,500
They spill their brothers' and sisters'
blood without a blink!

800
01:12:03,780 --> 01:12:08,190
I weep for the despicable hearts
of those people, my daughter.

801
01:12:09,270 --> 01:12:13,040
Which throne can defeat the
gratification of Allah?

802
01:12:13,490 --> 01:12:17,090
I weep for the inattentive Muslims
who don't understand this, my daughter.

803
01:12:17,790 --> 01:12:21,180
I cry for the Muslims who cannot
succeed in being a nation.

804
01:12:21,180 --> 01:12:25,310
And they crush each other's heads
for a handful of wheat, my daughter.

805
01:12:26,880 --> 01:12:28,800
How are we going to manage, my sheikh?

806
01:12:29,970 --> 01:12:32,090
How are we going to overcome, father?

807
01:12:32,120 --> 01:12:34,520
How will these Muslims gather themselves?

808
01:12:39,930 --> 01:12:40,770
Look.

809
01:12:42,050 --> 01:12:43,990
Let me tell you a story now, daughter.

810
01:12:45,870 --> 01:12:50,260
Tariq bin Ziyad,
the conqueror of Al-Andalus.

811
01:12:51,510 --> 01:12:52,640
The Blessed Commander.

812
01:12:53,170 --> 01:12:58,850
He did not run away from the war
in the name of Allah.

813
01:12:59,350 --> 01:13:03,640
And he always triumphed
with the allowence of Allah.

814
01:13:04,150 --> 01:13:05,490
He did.

815
01:13:06,590 --> 01:13:09,660
His commander,
who raised him to the rank of commander...

816
01:13:10,030 --> 01:13:13,250
...instead of rejoicing for
the spread of the call of Islam...

817
01:13:13,530 --> 01:13:18,500
...says Tariq bin Ziyad to stop.
"Stop already!"

818
01:13:19,330 --> 01:13:22,350
There was no reason for him to stop.

819
01:13:22,820 --> 01:13:26,990
In order to spread the word of Allah
all over the world...

820
01:13:27,540 --> 01:13:29,790
...he disobeyed his commander
and moved on...

821
01:13:30,340 --> 01:13:34,830
He said "Allah's call is
greater than my commander!"

822
01:13:35,290 --> 01:13:38,520
But the commander of Tariq bin Ziyad...

823
01:13:39,420 --> 01:13:43,990
...fumed because he didn't listen to him

824
01:13:44,850 --> 01:13:48,800
Do you see it?
Both are heading towards the same goalç

825
01:13:49,440 --> 01:13:52,600
But the commander of Tariq bin Ziyad...

826
01:13:53,450 --> 01:13:55,920
...was defeated by his greed...

827
01:13:56,280 --> 01:14:00,480
...he envied Tariq Bin Ziyad's victories.

828
01:14:01,170 --> 01:14:02,600
There it is, my daughter.

829
01:14:02,960 --> 01:14:06,960
What tore the nation apart is this envy.

830
01:14:08,310 --> 01:14:11,700
However, we should remember Allah's command

831
01:14:13,130 --> 01:14:22,370
He said, “Fight the infidels until there is
no sedition, and the only religion is Allah's."

832
01:14:22,850 --> 01:14:31,170
“If they desist, don't push.
Enmity is only for cruels”
[Surah Al-Baqarah 193]

833
01:14:32,500 --> 01:14:35,580
We will unite first and fight the infidels.

834
01:14:36,160 --> 01:14:38,280
We will hold fast to the rope of Allah.

835
01:14:38,440 --> 01:14:48,190
Then, even if all the world's evil,
idolaters, and hypocrites unite...

836
01:14:48,610 --> 01:14:50,840
They will not be able to divide our nation.

837
01:14:52,970 --> 01:14:58,400
There is no defeat for the nation that
clings to the rope of Allah, my daughter.

838
01:14:59,450 --> 01:15:02,000
Wherever we are...

839
01:15:02,430 --> 01:15:05,850
...We will not abandon our
fellowship and we will be united.

840
01:15:07,550 --> 01:15:10,270
We will keep our hearts strong
against the infidels.

841
01:15:12,430 --> 01:15:13,580
Inshallah, my sheikh.

842
01:15:15,210 --> 01:15:16,070
Inshallah.

843
01:15:18,650 --> 01:15:19,420
Inshallah.

844
01:15:24,400 --> 01:15:26,190
Nearly there!

845
01:15:29,270 --> 01:15:30,720
Alps!

846
01:15:30,720 --> 01:15:32,720
Take these buckets.

847
01:15:33,720 --> 01:15:36,550
I'm coming, my dear Bala, I'm coming!

848
01:15:39,000 --> 01:15:41,270
Come on Osman, come on Osman!

849
01:15:45,500 --> 01:15:48,070
Let's work hard, let's work hard!

850
01:16:12,820 --> 01:16:14,520
Come on, Olof.

851
01:16:16,700 --> 01:16:18,520
See why I called you.

852
01:16:31,350 --> 01:16:32,150
Come.

853
01:16:32,750 --> 01:16:36,470
Come, Osman Bey, let's see.

854
01:16:49,670 --> 01:16:51,400
What's going on, my Bey?

855
01:16:51,400 --> 01:16:54,620
No problem, no problem.

856
01:16:56,270 --> 01:16:58,100
Would you excuse me, my Bey?

857
01:16:58,900 --> 01:17:00,100
Come

858
01:17:05,920 --> 01:17:07,120
O Allah!

859
01:17:10,070 --> 01:17:11,320
O Allah!

860
01:17:11,870 --> 01:17:13,750
Oh Allah, in the name of Allah!

861
01:17:16,200 --> 01:17:17,470
Take it.

862
01:17:26,350 --> 01:17:27,270
What is that?

863
01:17:27,770 --> 01:17:31,650
The mouse is advancing towards the trap.

864
01:17:32,350 --> 01:17:36,220
I'm going to crush that mouse's head.

865
01:17:37,320 --> 01:17:40,870
Other mice will take a lesson from it.

866
01:17:51,700 --> 01:17:53,900
We will come out,
if Allah permits, my Bey.

867
01:17:53,900 --> 01:17:55,620
We'll come out.

868
01:17:56,070 --> 01:17:59,420
Hold on, my dear Bala.

869
01:18:07,400 --> 01:18:08,520
Let's go

870
01:18:10,170 --> 01:18:11,820
Stop, stop, stop.

871
01:18:18,250 --> 01:18:19,470
The tunnel has appeared.

872
01:18:19,900 --> 01:18:24,020
Give me that torch, I see it.

873
01:18:24,020 --> 01:18:25,200
Let's look.

874
01:18:25,200 --> 01:18:27,200
That's the place Samil mentioned.

875
01:18:27,800 --> 01:18:29,200
Come on.

876
01:18:34,620 --> 01:18:36,650
Easy.

877
01:18:47,600 --> 01:18:50,370
Come on, come on, brother.

878
01:18:50,750 --> 01:18:52,700
Come, Cerkutay, here.

879
01:18:52,700 --> 01:18:54,700
Come.

880
01:18:56,600 --> 01:18:57,920
Let's see

881
01:18:57,920 --> 01:18:59,920
Come on.

882
01:19:01,020 --> 01:19:03,870
- My Bey.
- Here.

883
01:19:03,870 --> 01:19:05,870
Come on, come on.

884
01:19:07,150 --> 01:19:08,120
Let's go.

885
01:19:08,800 --> 01:19:09,950
- Boran!
- My Bey!

886
01:19:09,950 --> 01:19:11,770
Boran, take the weapons.

887
01:19:11,770 --> 01:19:13,160
Take the weapons.

888
01:19:13,700 --> 01:19:15,970
Come on, come on.

889
01:19:18,220 --> 01:19:20,300
So Osman is coming here.

890
01:19:22,120 --> 01:19:29,350
I am grateful to you
for giving me this chance.

891
01:19:32,920 --> 01:19:37,820
Osman doesn't expect
to see Olof in front of him.

892
01:19:38,550 --> 01:19:43,820
Olof, you handed the castles
over to them with your own hands.

893
01:19:44,620 --> 01:19:47,150
Now is the time to fix it.

894
01:19:48,650 --> 01:19:50,100
For this reason...

895
01:19:52,300 --> 01:19:54,550
...this is your revenge.

896
01:19:54,920 --> 01:20:01,870
We'll make him pay for
everything he's done so far.

897
01:20:01,870 --> 01:20:05,370
Come on, show your skills.

898
01:20:07,170 --> 01:20:13,120
Osman will regret coming here.

899
01:20:15,500 --> 01:20:17,050
We are starting.

900
01:20:26,170 --> 01:20:27,270
Felic.

901
01:20:28,150 --> 01:20:30,450
You are going somewhere else.

902
01:20:54,150 --> 01:20:55,570
This path is dead.

903
01:20:55,570 --> 01:20:58,350
My Bey, the passage must be
behind the wall.

904
01:20:59,570 --> 01:21:02,270
Eyvallah, we will see.

905
01:21:04,020 --> 01:21:07,020
Give me, give me this.

906
01:21:07,020 --> 01:21:09,020
O Allah!

907
01:21:18,300 --> 01:21:20,650
O Allah!

908
01:21:22,650 --> 01:21:24,500
O Allah!

909
01:21:27,850 --> 01:21:33,250
Samil, like you said,
this place hits the corridor.

910
01:21:34,550 --> 01:21:35,870
We are on the right track.

911
01:21:36,600 --> 01:21:39,000
Come on, keep going, keep going.

912
01:21:42,270 --> 01:21:45,120
Come on, work hard, come on, work hard!

913
01:21:45,120 --> 01:21:47,120
Harder!

914
01:21:52,700 --> 01:21:54,900
Come on, my brothers.

915
01:21:57,050 --> 01:21:58,220
Let's go.

916
01:22:06,200 --> 01:22:07,850
Let's go.

917
01:22:07,850 --> 01:22:09,850
My Bey!

918
01:22:12,650 --> 01:22:14,620
Everyone take up their weapons!

919
01:22:18,370 --> 01:22:20,720
Let's go Gurbuz.

920
01:22:26,250 --> 01:22:27,800
Come on brothers!

921
01:22:31,170 --> 01:22:35,400
Alps, we'll take my sheikh and Bala
without making any noise.

922
01:22:35,400 --> 01:22:37,400
And after opening the doors...

923
01:22:37,400 --> 01:22:40,640
...We will cut off the head of anyone
involved in this betrayal!

924
01:22:40,640 --> 01:22:42,400
As you order my Bey!

925
01:22:42,720 --> 01:22:43,770
Let's go.

926
01:22:49,220 --> 01:22:50,820
Osman Bey is coming.

927
01:22:50,820 --> 01:22:54,000
I told you not to backdoor him!

928
01:22:54,000 --> 01:22:57,000
He is coming to a trap!

929
01:22:57,000 --> 01:23:00,850
Ismihan Sultan, the mother Sultan,
she is a snake, Oktem.

930
01:23:00,850 --> 01:23:03,100
Osman will not be able to
survive this time.

931
01:23:03,100 --> 01:23:07,800
Hatun, we are talking about Osman Bey,
sheik Edebali, Bala Hatun!

932
01:23:07,800 --> 01:23:09,270
We have to do something!

933
01:23:09,270 --> 01:23:11,270
There is nothing we can do anymore!

934
01:23:11,520 --> 01:23:15,750
The only thing we're going to do now is
to protect our heads.

935
01:23:15,750 --> 01:23:19,600
We cannot contradict Mother Sultan,
she is not like Osman.

936
01:23:19,600 --> 01:23:21,470
Mother Sultan is a demon, Oktem.

937
01:23:21,470 --> 01:23:25,370
The castle will be a grave f
or them all, Bengi, a grave!

938
01:23:25,370 --> 01:23:27,170
This is cruelty!

939
01:23:27,170 --> 01:23:30,400
Oktem Bey, Oktem Bey!
Oktem stop!

940
01:23:31,170 --> 01:23:34,050
If you are not thinking of yourself,
think of your daughter.

941
01:23:34,200 --> 01:23:38,650
In the tiniest mistake we make,
we'll pay it with Alcicek's life.

942
01:23:39,600 --> 01:23:41,320
I am also upset for them.

943
01:23:41,320 --> 01:23:42,900
But there is nothing we can do.

944
01:23:42,900 --> 01:23:44,170
Hatun, get away.

945
01:23:44,170 --> 01:23:46,900
Oktem Bey, Oktem Bey!
It's your daughter!

946
01:23:47,120 --> 01:23:48,520
It's Alcicek!

947
01:23:48,520 --> 01:23:50,520
Don't you hear me?

948
01:25:02,800 --> 01:25:04,520
The voices
come from this direction

949
01:25:04,520 --> 01:25:06,000
They are coming, my Bey!

950
01:25:06,070 --> 01:25:08,020
Cerkutay, hold there.

951
01:25:08,020 --> 01:25:09,670
Don't worry my Bey.

952
01:25:09,800 --> 01:25:11,020
We will show them.

953
01:25:11,020 --> 01:25:11,970
Let's go

954
01:25:11,970 --> 01:25:13,970
Boran.

955
01:25:14,800 --> 01:25:17,100
- Come on, brothers!
- Come to me!

956
01:25:41,320 --> 01:25:43,520
Come on brothers!

957
01:26:10,270 --> 01:26:11,670
Bala.

958
01:26:15,870 --> 01:26:17,520
Osman.

959
01:26:28,820 --> 01:26:29,800
My Bala.

960
01:26:31,370 --> 01:26:33,100
- My Bala.
- My Osman.

961
01:26:34,400 --> 01:26:35,800
Osman.

962
01:26:39,470 --> 01:26:40,670
Osman.

963
01:26:41,520 --> 01:26:42,850
Welcome, Osman.

964
01:26:42,850 --> 01:26:44,520
Ismihan.

965
01:26:46,770 --> 01:26:48,200
You again!

966
01:26:48,200 --> 01:26:51,750
Bala, Bala, if you touch Bala...

967
01:26:53,200 --> 01:26:54,750
Osman.

968
01:27:01,620 --> 01:27:03,420
My sheikh.

969
01:27:03,920 --> 01:27:05,920
We were waiting for you.

970
01:27:07,450 --> 01:27:10,600
The only thing you are waiting for
is your death.

971
01:27:15,270 --> 01:27:18,170
We are superior now Osman.

972
01:27:21,900 --> 01:27:27,020
The few have overcome the many before.

973
01:27:28,620 --> 01:27:31,470
I will defeat you badly.

974
01:27:32,820 --> 01:27:35,700
I will defeat you badly.

975
01:27:36,150 --> 01:27:37,700
You can't even imagine it.

976
01:27:41,820 --> 01:27:42,900
Osman!

977
01:27:45,600 --> 01:27:48,370
Did you think there would be
no return for your actions?

978
01:27:51,820 --> 01:27:53,170
Don't you dare!

979
01:27:53,170 --> 01:27:56,400
Bring Mesut, take your Hatun.

980
01:27:56,400 --> 01:27:59,150
Hands off of her!

981
01:27:59,150 --> 01:28:01,750
Ismihan, I will kill you!

982
01:28:01,750 --> 01:28:05,100
Don't you dare touch Bala!
Don't you dare to hurt her hair!

983
01:28:05,100 --> 01:28:07,100
Don't you dare to hurt her!

984
01:28:10,400 --> 01:28:13,900
This is my last warning to you!

985
01:28:14,600 --> 01:28:15,900
If you don't bring Mesut...

986
01:28:17,220 --> 01:28:18,550
...I will cut her neck.

987
01:28:21,920 --> 01:28:24,450
We are ready to sacrifice our lives,
Osman Bey.

988
01:28:24,450 --> 01:28:27,320
Your dreams that will come true
will make you real.

989
01:28:27,750 --> 01:28:28,720
Go.

990
01:28:28,720 --> 01:28:31,440
- I'm not going anywhere
- We have to go, come on my Bey!

991
01:28:31,440 --> 01:28:34,370
Go, Osman Bey, for your sons.

992
01:28:34,370 --> 01:28:35,670
I will not go anywhere

993
01:28:35,670 --> 01:28:38,550
They are your honesty, go for God's sake, go

994
01:28:38,550 --> 01:28:40,550
My Bey, they keep coming over us!

995
01:28:40,550 --> 01:28:42,550
We have to go out, come on, my Bey!

996
01:28:42,550 --> 01:28:44,520
- My Bala
- Go.

997
01:28:45,020 --> 01:28:46,670
We have to get out, my Bey!

998
01:28:46,670 --> 01:28:48,670
- Bala!
- Osman!

999
01:28:48,970 --> 01:28:50,670
- Sheikh!
- Osman!

1000
01:28:51,120 --> 01:28:53,500
You have to go for
the future of our community.

1001
01:28:53,500 --> 01:28:55,500
- No!
- Go Osman.

1002
01:28:55,500 --> 01:28:56,550
I can't go, my sheikh.

1003
01:28:56,550 --> 01:28:58,650
Osman, you have to go.

1004
01:28:58,720 --> 01:29:01,020
Come on, come on!

1005
01:29:01,020 --> 01:29:03,550
- Come on, come on.
- I'll come, Bala!

1006
01:29:03,550 --> 01:29:05,550
I'll come back!

1007
01:29:23,120 --> 01:29:27,020
What do you keep looking at
like curious women, Hussein?

1008
01:29:31,000 --> 01:29:33,400
Osman Bey is about to be here.

1009
01:29:33,770 --> 01:29:36,970
Our life depends half on Mother Sultan...

1010
01:29:36,970 --> 01:29:38,550
And the other half on Osman.

1011
01:29:38,550 --> 01:29:40,550
And you hang around here like this!

1012
01:29:40,550 --> 01:29:41,950
Stand tall!

1013
01:29:41,950 --> 01:29:43,620
And don't make me angry!

1014
01:29:43,620 --> 01:29:45,620
I am fully prepared, my Bey!

1015
01:29:46,570 --> 01:29:52,270
I am looking to see if there is a passage
connecting here to another place.

1016
01:29:52,850 --> 01:29:54,800
Infidels build
such corridors in their castles.

1017
01:29:55,770 --> 01:29:57,700
Oh Huseyin!

1018
01:29:58,870 --> 01:30:01,050
You birdrain Huseyin.

1019
01:30:04,270 --> 01:30:09,270
He assumes there's a secret tunnel,
and he assumes it's in our room.

1020
01:30:12,900 --> 01:30:16,900
Mother Sultan on one hand,
Osman on the other...

1021
01:30:17,320 --> 01:30:18,750
Also Huseyin.

1022
01:30:19,620 --> 01:30:22,320
Oh poor Bayindir.

1023
01:30:22,320 --> 01:30:24,320
You are always in trouble!

1024
01:30:24,850 --> 01:30:26,750
Come on, I won't stay here any longer.

1025
01:30:31,650 --> 01:30:33,070
Where to, Bayindir Bey?

1026
01:30:33,480 --> 01:30:34,850
To hell.

1027
01:30:34,850 --> 01:30:35,980
You want to come?

1028
01:30:38,410 --> 01:30:43,180
Bayindir, I really wonder.
To whom you are more loyal?

1029
01:30:43,180 --> 01:30:46,200
To your treasure, or mother Sultan?

1030
01:30:46,540 --> 01:30:49,480
What are you trying to say?
Get away.

1031
01:30:51,570 --> 01:30:52,680
Do not you dare.

1032
01:30:58,930 --> 01:31:04,330
The gold you stole from Olof and took
via the pact, the treasury.

1033
01:31:05,120 --> 01:31:08,850
Do you think that our Mother Sultan
does not know this richness of yours?

1034
01:31:10,130 --> 01:31:14,240
That you can sell everyone
at any moment for gold?

1035
01:31:17,700 --> 01:31:22,330
My treasury is my right.

1036
01:31:23,970 --> 01:31:26,400
Mother Sultan is another thing.

1037
01:31:27,180 --> 01:31:29,320
My treasure is a whole other thing.

1038
01:31:29,320 --> 01:31:32,760
No, not another thing.

1039
01:31:32,760 --> 01:31:35,780
Our Mother Sultan says
you will only choose one.

1040
01:31:35,970 --> 01:31:40,240
Otherwise, she will always
doubt your loyalty.

1041
01:31:40,620 --> 01:31:44,400
You know that the Mother Sultan
does not like suspicion

1042
01:31:44,400 --> 01:31:49,810
And those who makes her suspicous
are doomed to die.

1043
01:31:54,400 --> 01:31:56,010
What do you want? Tell me.

1044
01:31:57,560 --> 01:32:02,040
Not me, our Mother Sultan
demands that you prove your loyalty.

1045
01:32:02,530 --> 01:32:06,700
Good, I will stand against Osman.

1046
01:32:07,520 --> 01:32:11,250
I will help you trap him.
What does she want more of me?

1047
01:32:11,610 --> 01:32:15,370
Your gold that is
more precious than your soul!

1048
01:32:15,810 --> 01:32:19,220
You will give it all to
Mother Sultan's service.

1049
01:32:23,930 --> 01:32:25,380
Okay then.

1050
01:32:27,500 --> 01:32:31,130
I shall sacrifice them for our
Mother Sultan.

1051
01:32:32,000 --> 01:32:37,400
Both our lives and our wealth.

1052
01:32:52,740 --> 01:32:56,650
My Sultan, you came here
from Konya on horseback.

1053
01:32:56,650 --> 01:32:58,530
The carriage goes empty at the back.

1054
01:32:58,530 --> 01:33:04,220
Neither the horse is difficult for the Turk
nor the Turk is a burden on the horse.

1055
01:33:04,680 --> 01:33:07,260
The people will see me on the horse.

1056
01:33:08,010 --> 01:33:12,820
Mother Sultan's power may be insufficient
for those rebels.

1057
01:33:12,820 --> 01:33:16,980
They will see me as a leader with my army.

1058
01:33:45,580 --> 01:33:48,210
- Peace be upon you
- Peace be upon you too.

1059
01:33:48,210 --> 01:33:51,610
Welcome to the frontier lands,
Hadrat Sultan Aladdin.

1060
01:33:52,570 --> 01:33:53,900
Say your name.

1061
01:33:53,900 --> 01:33:57,420
You must have heard.
I am your servant, Turgut Bey.

1062
01:33:57,420 --> 01:34:01,680
I am here to serve you and
Mother Sultan.

1063
01:34:02,530 --> 01:34:09,160
Mother Sultan ordered me to welcome you
properly, and accompany you to Sogut.

1064
01:34:09,530 --> 01:34:12,300
Mother Sultan is in Marmaracik.

1065
01:34:15,210 --> 01:34:16,840
Why did she ask you to accompany
me to Sogut?

1066
01:34:22,260 --> 01:34:25,500
- Hadrat Sultan.
- Soldier!

1067
01:34:51,480 --> 01:34:53,060
Hadrat Sultan.

1068
01:35:19,900 --> 01:35:24,200
Do you think we weren't informed of the
theft of Mother Sultan's seal?

1069
01:35:39,680 --> 01:35:41,860
Do not blame me, Hadrat Vizier.

1070
01:35:42,170 --> 01:35:44,620
But the information you were given
is incomplete.

1071
01:35:44,620 --> 01:35:48,570
Mother Sultan got her seal back
before she killed Osman.

1072
01:35:48,570 --> 01:35:52,640
And I know that she holds very
important prisoners.

1073
01:35:53,170 --> 01:35:56,180
How will we know that
your tongue speaks the truth?

1074
01:35:57,520 --> 01:36:00,610
There is an endless army
behind you, Vizier.

1075
01:36:01,170 --> 01:36:03,810
We are not that crazy to deceive you.

1076
01:36:04,210 --> 01:36:06,330
What I would like to say, my Sultan...

1077
01:36:06,330 --> 01:36:09,180
It is for your best to go to Sogut
before Marmaracik.

1078
01:36:09,180 --> 01:36:12,240
Mother Sultan says that this
is the most important of all.

1079
01:36:16,640 --> 01:36:20,900
If you don't want to waste your life,
get out of our way

1080
01:36:21,210 --> 01:36:22,900
We will go to Marmaracik.

1081
01:36:29,170 --> 01:36:30,850
We are going to Sogut.

1082
01:36:40,130 --> 01:36:41,880
But, my Sultan....

1083
01:37:09,780 --> 01:37:13,620
Father.
Father.

1084
01:37:19,690 --> 01:37:22,080
How did you face all those
ignoble dogs?

1085
01:37:25,640 --> 01:37:28,180
How did you overcome
all this sedition?

1086
01:37:30,370 --> 01:37:32,570
You entrusted everything to me.

1087
01:37:34,800 --> 01:37:36,920
You thought I was fit for this.

1088
01:37:37,910 --> 01:37:39,990
You wanted to improve our inheritence.

1089
01:37:42,420 --> 01:37:45,480
You wanted to expand the Kayi.

1090
01:37:52,170 --> 01:37:54,260
Let's not leave our father alone, brother.

1091
01:37:56,570 --> 01:37:58,930
He said, "No one should come with me"
brother.

1092
01:38:00,480 --> 01:38:04,040
I do not hesitate to disobey our father
for the sake of him, brother.

1093
01:38:04,220 --> 01:38:07,920
I listened to my mother's words,
I left her alone.

1094
01:38:09,980 --> 01:38:12,460
At least we can stay
with our father, brother.

1095
01:38:16,360 --> 01:38:18,220
You say the right thing, my brother.

1096
01:38:18,530 --> 01:38:22,860
He does not need loneliness now,
he needs his children.

1097
01:38:23,210 --> 01:38:32,160
Father, you didn't have all these tribes
and Beys behind you.

1098
01:38:33,200 --> 01:38:40,880
And you didn't have all these alps
and you didn't have all that authority.

1099
01:38:43,580 --> 01:38:44,640
Tell me.

1100
01:38:46,000 --> 01:38:48,410
In such a dead end...

1101
01:38:50,850 --> 01:38:55,140
...what would you do?
What?

1102
01:38:59,170 --> 01:39:00,320
But...

1103
01:39:03,570 --> 01:39:05,280
Do not tell me as my father.

1104
01:39:07,910 --> 01:39:09,540
Noy as my Bey.

1105
01:39:11,820 --> 01:39:14,760
Tell me as Ertugrul Ghazi.

1106
01:39:14,760 --> 01:39:20,810
I know, of course, that my path
is certainly more difficult than before.

1107
01:39:21,100 --> 01:39:24,960
I know that my enemies are more
unjust than before.

1108
01:39:27,730 --> 01:39:32,140
You opened a path for us,
the path is bumpy and difficult.

1109
01:39:33,410 --> 01:39:35,610
But I will keep walking.

1110
01:39:42,060 --> 01:39:44,780
You are the one who made me
rule everyone.

1111
01:39:46,540 --> 01:39:50,880
No, I will not despair.

1112
01:39:51,770 --> 01:39:54,180
I will never despair, never.

1113
01:40:00,500 --> 01:40:06,680
I will back off
if necessary and give up if necessary

1114
01:40:08,680 --> 01:40:10,500
I even...

1115
01:40:14,860 --> 01:40:17,340
...I will sacrifice when the time comes.

1116
01:40:21,210 --> 01:40:24,820
I should not enter into a war in which
I will be defeated and destroyed.

1117
01:40:36,120 --> 01:40:40,810
It is time to accept the lost now.

1118
01:41:23,130 --> 01:41:24,130
Father.

1119
01:41:26,570 --> 01:41:31,580
As long as we have children these...
as long as you have grandchildren like these...

1120
01:41:35,460 --> 01:41:37,600
I should protect them.

1121
01:41:42,810 --> 01:41:45,290
Let them cut our branches.

1122
01:41:47,480 --> 01:41:49,420
Our roots are strong.

1123
01:41:58,160 --> 01:41:59,930
Sogut.

1124
01:42:00,160 --> 01:42:06,570
- Welcome Sultan Aladdin.
- You brought joy, my Sultan.

1125
01:42:06,570 --> 01:42:09,700
- Welcome our Sultan!
- Welcome!

1126
01:42:09,700 --> 01:42:13,380
- Welcome.
- Welcome

1127
01:42:13,380 --> 01:42:19,180
My Sultan! My Sultan!
My son is very sick. Please help.

1128
01:42:19,800 --> 01:42:22,210
My son is very sick.

1129
01:42:22,210 --> 01:42:26,300
- Welcome!
- Welcome, Sultan!

1130
01:42:30,840 --> 01:42:32,640
Welcome, my Sultan!

1131
01:42:33,220 --> 01:42:35,200
You have honored us, my Sultan.

1132
01:42:35,200 --> 01:42:37,200
Hadrat Sultan Aladdin.

1133
01:42:39,800 --> 01:42:42,420
The situation is bad, as you can see.

1134
01:42:43,970 --> 01:42:46,830
This is the situation that Osman Bey
put people into.

1135
01:42:46,940 --> 01:42:49,770
Mother Sultan wanted you to see
the situation beforehand.

1136
01:42:50,860 --> 01:42:52,960
We have seen it all now, Turgur Bey.

1137
01:42:54,170 --> 01:42:56,460
- Vizier.
- My Sultan.

1138
01:42:57,360 --> 01:43:02,470
Ask the healers of Konya so that this matter
can be resolved before the disease worsen.s

1139
01:43:04,050 --> 01:43:06,650
As ordered by Hadrat Sultan.

1140
01:43:07,570 --> 01:43:11,600
There is also a person in the inn
that Mother Sultan would like you to see.

1141
01:43:11,600 --> 01:43:12,690
Who is it?

1142
01:43:14,060 --> 01:43:15,520
Malhun Hatun.

1143
01:43:18,010 --> 01:43:22,520
Unlike Osman Bey, she worked hard to
fight against the disease in Sogut.

1144
01:43:24,730 --> 01:43:25,900
Let's see her.

1145
01:43:27,640 --> 01:43:30,370
We will quickly go to Marmaracik then.

1146
01:43:30,810 --> 01:43:33,400
I will stay here awaiting your order.

1147
01:44:42,340 --> 01:44:44,480
Either we will be dragged together.

1148
01:44:50,300 --> 01:45:02,980
Or we will give up the dream of
a state for the sake of those we love.

1149
01:45:04,840 --> 01:45:08,920
Or we will find a third way.

1150
01:45:14,450 --> 01:45:16,410
Like my father did.

1151
01:45:20,450 --> 01:45:21,820
Boran!

1152
01:45:25,920 --> 01:45:27,220
My Bey.

1153
01:45:27,220 --> 01:45:29,040
We are going to Sultan Mesut.

1154
01:45:29,490 --> 01:45:31,040
As you order, my Bey.

1155
01:45:42,360 --> 01:45:44,740
Marmaracik Castle.

1156
01:45:49,240 --> 01:45:52,760
Excuse me for
my audacity, Mother Sultan, but...

1157
01:45:52,760 --> 01:45:56,930
...sheikh Edebali, the light of Oghuz.

1158
01:45:57,280 --> 01:46:00,040
You won't hang him too, will you?

1159
01:46:00,850 --> 01:46:05,770
- If our community riots...
- If our people riot for a betrayer...

1160
01:46:05,940 --> 01:46:09,720
...they have to accept the
consequences, Bengi Hatun.

1161
01:46:17,540 --> 01:46:27,820
Both Sheikh Edebali and Bala's lives
are up to Osman.

1162
01:46:29,960 --> 01:46:33,450
If he surrenders and bows down...

1163
01:46:34,020 --> 01:46:36,340
...things may change.

1164
01:46:36,910 --> 01:46:40,590
I am amazed by your thoughts, Ismihan.

1165
01:46:41,460 --> 01:46:46,490
Oppressors like you are the ones
who caused the martyrdom of Hadrat Sumeyye.

1166
01:46:50,110 --> 01:46:53,440
But Allah Almighty punished
them for what they did

1167
01:46:53,760 --> 01:46:56,280
Their end is hell.

1168
01:46:56,420 --> 01:46:57,960
Look at that!

1169
01:46:58,610 --> 01:47:05,370
You are the one who decides who goes to
heaven and who goes to hell.

1170
01:47:06,400 --> 01:47:09,350
You are the symbol of arrogance.

1171
01:47:11,090 --> 01:47:13,400
I am not surprised.

1172
01:47:13,730 --> 01:47:16,140
Your end will be the same.

1173
01:47:16,300 --> 01:47:19,410
You will be deprived of the
mercy of Allah.

1174
01:47:19,600 --> 01:47:23,200
This will be enough for you.

1175
01:47:23,980 --> 01:47:29,880
The Sheikh's daughter must
not be so arrogant, sheikh Edebali.

1176
01:47:30,310 --> 01:47:34,370
If you had raised her properly at the time...

1177
01:47:34,780 --> 01:47:38,720
...Bala Hatun wouldn't be at the
door of death now.

1178
01:47:39,240 --> 01:47:41,430
And neither would you, of course.

1179
01:47:41,670 --> 01:47:46,790
My Allah, who did not leave Hadrat Yunus
alone in the belly of a whale...

1180
01:47:47,000 --> 01:47:52,250
...will certainly not leave us alone
in the hands of an oppressor like you.

1181
01:47:52,520 --> 01:47:55,390
I totally believe in Him.

1182
01:47:55,820 --> 01:47:57,740
As for you...

1183
01:47:57,930 --> 01:47:59,990
Ismihan Hatun...

1184
01:48:00,260 --> 01:48:03,480
Fire will surround your mouth.

1185
01:48:08,100 --> 01:48:11,270
Even talking to you is useless.

1186
01:48:11,480 --> 01:48:14,760
Avci, tie their mouths.

1187
01:48:14,970 --> 01:48:18,650
or else I will take their lives
before Osman arrives!

1188
01:48:51,440 --> 01:48:53,980
Welcome, my Sultan..

1189
01:48:54,090 --> 01:48:59,800
I am Malhun Hatun, Umur Bey's daughter,
Osman Bey's Hatun.

1190
01:49:01,040 --> 01:49:04,130
Sogut belongs to us.

1191
01:49:04,590 --> 01:49:09,320
And you are our guests
like Mother Sultan.

1192
01:49:09,590 --> 01:49:13,350
My mother obviously didn't make
things clear enough for you.

1193
01:49:13,950 --> 01:49:18,380
Everything that belongs to you
is ours, Malhun Hatun.

1194
01:49:19,410 --> 01:49:21,870
So please, my Sultan.

1195
01:49:22,090 --> 01:49:24,900
Act like you are in your property.

1196
01:49:36,370 --> 01:49:38,320
What is this situation?

1197
01:49:39,400 --> 01:49:42,000
The situation is bad, my Sultan.

1198
01:49:42,270 --> 01:49:47,220
Mother Sultan left Sogut
due to the disease.

1199
01:49:47,660 --> 01:49:50,410
And we struggle a lot.

1200
01:49:50,690 --> 01:49:53,150
The spread of disease
will definitely be stopped.

1201
01:49:53,340 --> 01:49:55,660
The wounds will certainly be healed.

1202
01:49:56,420 --> 01:49:59,370
But what Osman did...

1203
01:50:00,960 --> 01:50:05,620
He'll pay with his head.
You know that, right?

1204
01:50:06,540 --> 01:50:09,570
If I supported what my Bey did...

1205
01:50:09,890 --> 01:50:14,820
...I would not mention my father's name
first while introducing myself, my Sultan.

1206
01:50:15,600 --> 01:50:17,630
Great.

1207
01:50:18,790 --> 01:50:21,470
I called healers from Konya.

1208
01:50:21,980 --> 01:50:25,580
They will get here as soon as
possible and help you.

1209
01:50:25,740 --> 01:50:29,320
- I have no other business here.
- My Sultan.

1210
01:50:30,400 --> 01:50:33,320
We made all these preparations for you.

1211
01:50:33,510 --> 01:50:37,460
If you don't join us, we'll grieve.

1212
01:50:49,280 --> 01:50:51,420
Okay then.

1213
01:50:56,850 --> 01:50:58,690
My Sultan.

1214
01:51:00,290 --> 01:51:03,400
Call the chief!

1215
01:51:10,270 --> 01:51:14,490
There must be a chief of Sultan.

1216
01:51:14,650 --> 01:51:17,790
We should do like this, Malhun Hatun:

1217
01:51:18,040 --> 01:51:23,800
An ingredient can be good on its own,
and poison when mixed with another ingredient.

1218
01:51:24,070 --> 01:51:29,290
If we put the ingredients that will
put Sultan to sleep in different meals...

1219
01:51:29,480 --> 01:51:31,830
Sultan will fall into a deep sleep.

1220
01:51:32,080 --> 01:51:37,950
No evidence of this will remain,
but the chief shouldn't taste them first.

1221
01:51:38,110 --> 01:51:42,380
No, the chief will taste everything.

1222
01:51:42,710 --> 01:51:44,710
However...

1223
01:51:45,600 --> 01:51:48,330
If we put antidote too...

1224
01:51:48,500 --> 01:51:52,370
...the Sultan will sleep,
but the chief will not.

1225
01:51:53,290 --> 01:51:57,340
Thus, no one will suspect.

1226
01:52:03,430 --> 01:52:06,220
In the name of Allah,
Most Gracious, Most Merciful

1227
01:52:23,580 --> 01:52:29,050
- I myself cooked all of these, my Sultan.
- Come on hurry up.

1228
01:53:00,920 --> 01:53:03,190
Good to go, my Sultan.

1229
01:53:11,280 --> 01:53:14,520
I respect your decision, Osman Bey.

1230
01:53:15,420 --> 01:53:17,740
Eyvallah, my Sultan.

1231
01:53:17,900 --> 01:53:22,690
I told you in the beginning.
This is a big risk

1232
01:53:23,500 --> 01:53:26,050
You should have left me to death.

1233
01:53:26,340 --> 01:53:28,910
Not just for you.

1234
01:53:30,670 --> 01:53:34,350
I thought it would be a good move
for us too.

1235
01:53:35,650 --> 01:53:38,330
But that Ismihan...

1236
01:53:39,300 --> 01:53:42,390
She tied our hands!

1237
01:53:45,960 --> 01:53:50,880
- Forgive us if we made any mistake.
- No, no Osman Bey.

1238
01:53:51,180 --> 01:53:53,420
I was basically a dead man.

1239
01:53:53,720 --> 01:53:59,380
I used to lead armies in wars and terrorize
the enemy in battlefields in the past

1240
01:53:59,860 --> 01:54:02,350
But they made me rot.

1241
01:54:03,430 --> 01:54:06,410
But you gave me a purpose.

1242
01:54:06,570 --> 01:54:10,300
And now I am walking
towards death for this goal.

1243
01:54:10,600 --> 01:54:13,250
You have my blessings.

1244
01:54:16,720 --> 01:54:19,370
I give you my blessings too...

1245
01:54:20,940 --> 01:54:22,860
I certainly do.

1246
01:54:25,890 --> 01:54:27,670
Let's go

1247
01:54:28,080 --> 01:54:33,240
It was my destiny to die at the hands
of a friend while I fight the enemy

1248
01:54:36,710 --> 01:54:38,870
Let's go, Osman Bey.

1249
01:54:41,120 --> 01:54:43,310
Let's go.

1250
01:54:46,150 --> 01:54:48,770
We shall go.

1251
01:55:09,770 --> 01:55:13,550
- Thanks
- Enjoy it.

1252
01:55:14,310 --> 01:55:17,640
Prepare my horses, soldiers

1253
01:55:17,880 --> 01:55:19,750
We will go to Marmaracik.

1254
01:55:21,020 --> 01:55:23,990
How about resting a bit more?

1255
01:55:27,080 --> 01:55:29,540
My mother is waiting for me.

1256
01:55:30,620 --> 01:55:33,330
I don't want her to wait any longer.

1257
01:55:38,600 --> 01:55:42,340
I have prepared your room, my Sultan.

1258
01:55:42,470 --> 01:55:44,310
You came from a long way.

1259
01:55:44,530 --> 01:55:48,230
Your mother would also
be sad if she saw you so tired.

1260
01:55:48,350 --> 01:55:49,600
No.

1261
01:55:50,390 --> 01:55:52,520
No.

1262
01:55:53,940 --> 01:55:56,390
I have to go to Marmaracik.

1263
01:55:59,090 --> 01:56:02,280
I have to go to Marmaracik.

1264
01:56:09,290 --> 01:56:12,620
The Sultan is clearly tired.

1265
01:56:14,270 --> 01:56:16,260
My Sultan.

1266
01:56:16,640 --> 01:56:21,340
Please let us take you to your room.
You should rest.

1267
01:56:23,300 --> 01:56:26,100
Have a good sleep, my Sultan.

1268
01:57:32,910 --> 01:57:35,880
Sheikh Edebali, the greatness.

1269
01:57:36,070 --> 01:57:40,070
It's not possible, Hatun,
it's not possible.

1270
01:57:43,610 --> 01:57:50,300
We are never going to get rid of
this disgrace. Never.

1271
01:57:50,770 --> 01:57:53,290
We can't disobey the order, Bey.

1272
01:57:53,650 --> 01:57:59,350
This is not something
you can just watch, Hatun. It's Edebali.

1273
01:58:01,930 --> 01:58:05,120
All Turkmens will rise up.

1274
01:58:10,980 --> 01:58:18,740
You think Osman will catch up and not
let him hang, is that so, Bey?

1275
01:58:21,280 --> 01:58:28,270
Osman Bey has no other choice
except for surrendering, Hatun.

1276
01:58:48,300 --> 01:58:52,370
Near Iznik.

1277
01:59:43,460 --> 01:59:44,580
Who is there?

1278
01:59:46,580 --> 01:59:47,680
Who is there?

1279
01:59:48,720 --> 01:59:52,920
Do you invite me to meet
and set a trap for me? What's it?

1280
01:59:54,320 --> 01:59:59,830
Kantakouzanos, not everyone can know
the secret, not everyone can see us!

1281
02:00:05,170 --> 02:00:07,060
Welcome, Kantakouzanos.

1282
02:00:07,880 --> 02:00:10,660
You could have asked me to come alone.

1283
02:00:10,850 --> 02:00:12,660
I could have done this.

1284
02:00:13,380 --> 02:00:15,540
- Go ahead, I'm listening
- Come.

1285
02:00:32,310 --> 02:00:36,680
Our lands covered
all of this map years ago.

1286
02:00:37,360 --> 02:00:39,760
The people of Konya and Osman
imprisoned us.

1287
02:00:40,420 --> 02:00:43,140
I'm past the age of
taking history lessons.

1288
02:00:43,780 --> 02:00:49,040
If you have something to say, speak up,
otherwise you're wasting my time...

1289
02:00:49,040 --> 02:00:51,460
We're getting started, Kantakouzanos.

1290
02:00:52,160 --> 02:00:56,500
Konya had weakened Osman and
now his neck is under my sword.

1291
02:00:57,060 --> 02:01:01,140
We will destroy not only Osman,
but also Konya.

1292
02:01:01,940 --> 02:01:05,010
- ısmihan is my ally.
- She is not anymore.

1293
02:01:06,210 --> 02:01:09,600
We have been in touch with
Ghazan, the Mongol Khan for a while now

1294
02:01:10,950 --> 02:01:13,460
He is also annoyed by the problems here.

1295
02:01:13,750 --> 02:01:16,070
We will unite and crush them!

1296
02:01:16,370 --> 02:01:18,660
Everyone in these lands
will be our slaves.

1297
02:01:19,140 --> 02:01:22,640
The secret that will give us this power
has risen again.

1298
02:01:22,760 --> 02:01:24,420
Go ahead, I'm listening.

1299
02:01:25,250 --> 02:01:29,440
Our real ally will tell you the rest.

1300
02:01:43,250 --> 02:01:51,060
I bear witness that there is no God but Allah, and I bear
witness that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger

1301
02:01:56,230 --> 02:02:03,540
I bear witness that there is no God but Allah, and I bear
witness that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger

1302
02:02:33,680 --> 02:02:36,770
My Bey, is this the only solution?

1303
02:02:38,260 --> 02:02:40,700
Are you saying that
this is too difficult for you?

1304
02:02:41,560 --> 02:02:43,920
- We should come too, my Bey!
- Yes my Bey!

1305
02:02:44,160 --> 02:02:48,320
No, just me and Sultan Mesut.

1306
02:02:54,310 --> 02:02:56,740
Some wars are fought alone.

1307
02:02:58,740 --> 02:03:02,740
Sir, this cause is all of our cause.

1308
02:03:03,240 --> 02:03:06,130
We are together even when we are alone!

1309
02:03:11,940 --> 02:03:13,000
Eyvallah.

1310
02:03:14,450 --> 02:03:15,970
Eyvallah, Alps.

1311
02:03:29,560 --> 02:03:31,350
Osman Bey is coming.

1312
02:03:44,520 --> 02:03:46,950
- Bala.
- Osman.

1313
02:04:25,510 --> 02:04:26,420
Bala.

1314
02:04:30,710 --> 02:04:31,560
My sheikh.

1315
02:04:38,470 --> 02:04:43,840
Mesut, the impostor sultan
of the Seljuk state!

1316
02:04:47,490 --> 02:04:50,960
And his partner, the traitor, Osman.

1317
02:04:53,350 --> 02:04:56,870
You two disobeyed Sultan Aladdin.

1318
02:05:35,280 --> 02:05:39,030
So you are also with us, Vizier.

1319
02:05:39,830 --> 02:05:42,800
- Does Mother Sultan know this?
- No.

1320
02:05:43,990 --> 02:05:48,180
Neither Mother Sultan nor Sultan Aladdin.

1321
02:05:48,390 --> 02:05:50,070
No one knows.

1322
02:05:50,920 --> 02:05:53,380
I only serve myself.

1323
02:05:56,360 --> 02:05:59,220
So you say that you are a man
who cannot be trusted.

1324
02:05:59,270 --> 02:06:04,480
On the contrary, I am the man you trust
the most as long as our goals are the same.

1325
02:06:06,100 --> 02:06:09,320
Let's cut it short.
Tell me, what's the secret?

1326
02:06:14,450 --> 02:06:19,670
A relic was stolen from
Constantinople years ago.

1327
02:06:19,670 --> 02:06:20,960
Do you remember?

1328
02:06:21,750 --> 02:06:22,960
Holy cross.

1329
02:06:23,840 --> 02:06:25,380
It is in Osman's hands.

1330
02:06:27,600 --> 02:06:31,620
It was said that it went to Jerusalem
with a priest.

1331
02:06:32,880 --> 02:06:38,070
War is like this,
whether it is in politics or in the arena.

1332
02:06:39,380 --> 02:06:42,720
You know what the winners want you to know.

1333
02:06:43,670 --> 02:06:46,290
This is what Osman wanted you to know.

1334
02:06:48,290 --> 02:06:50,440
Why do you say this now?

1335
02:06:52,660 --> 02:06:57,640
As the Cardinal said,
we will unite at the order of Ghazan Khan.

1336
02:06:58,680 --> 02:07:03,160
We will destroy the unity of
Turks and Muslims on this land.

1337
02:07:03,160 --> 02:07:04,850
They will become our slaves.

1338
02:07:06,850 --> 02:07:08,770
Holy Cross will ensure this.

1339
02:07:08,770 --> 02:07:13,960
I know, and that's why we're sharing
this information with you.

1340
02:07:19,460 --> 02:07:20,680
Look, Vizier.

1341
02:07:22,680 --> 02:07:24,100
I'll take that cross.

1342
02:07:26,080 --> 02:07:27,920
But I want you to know this.

1343
02:07:29,670 --> 02:07:33,140
You too, like the Turks,
are guests in this land.

1344
02:07:34,870 --> 02:07:36,740
You are unwanted guests.

1345
02:07:38,390 --> 02:07:40,770
That's why when the war ends.

1346
02:07:42,400 --> 02:07:46,070
The lion's share is Byzantine's.

1347
02:07:50,880 --> 02:07:53,220
- All the secret...
- Vizier!

1348
02:07:54,370 --> 02:07:56,230
I only say my word once.

1349
02:07:57,890 --> 02:08:03,120
If you want to deal with me,
you have to agree to my terms.

1350
02:08:20,020 --> 02:08:21,730
What's happening here?

1351
02:08:25,520 --> 02:08:26,770
My head!

1352
02:08:27,410 --> 02:08:28,770
My head!

1353
02:08:32,870 --> 02:08:35,920
Soldier, prepare my horse.

1354
02:08:36,960 --> 02:08:38,770
We will go to Marmarcik.

1355
02:08:52,630 --> 02:08:57,160
You wanted Sultan Mesut, here he is.

1356
02:09:05,750 --> 02:09:07,750
You asked for me, and here I am.

1357
02:09:13,300 --> 02:09:17,480
She threatened me with
Bala and my sheikh.

1358
02:09:27,810 --> 02:09:29,160
Here I am.

1359
02:09:31,160 --> 02:09:33,120
- Hang them!
- What?

1360
02:09:42,420 --> 02:09:43,590
My sheikh!

1361
02:09:56,280 --> 02:10:15,400
